Pf3D7_01_v3	chado	mRNA	29510	37126	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0100100.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.11-CIDRa2.8-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB3 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:11544371,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:6374009;Parent=PF3D7_0100100;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0100100,OPI:PFA0005w,UniProtKB:Q9NFB6;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2125-2125%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.46799996;Ontology_term=GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020002,GO:0020033,GO:0098609,GO:0046789,GO:0016021,GO:0009405;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0041200 link%3DPRCDC_0041200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710500 link%3DPRCDC_0710500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808600 link%3DPF3D7_0808600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239600 link%3DPRCDC_1239600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239500 link%3DPRCDC_1239500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0036200 link%3DPRCDC_0036200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0617400 link%3DPF3D7_0617400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003500 link%3DPRCDC_0003500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200100 link%3DPF3D7_0200100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0418200 link%3DPRCDC_0418200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1200100 link%3DPF3D7_1200100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0833500 link%3DPF3D7_0833500.1: