Pf3D7_01_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	78241	79891	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0101500.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7606788,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371,PMID:18785843;Parent=PF3D7_0101500;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0101500;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1039400 link%3DPF3D7_1039400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0221900 link%3DPF3D7_0221900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0601400 link%3DPF3D7_0601400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0323200 link%3DPRCDC_0323200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0631200 link%3DPF3D7_0631200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0323900 link%3DPF3D7_0323900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL4933%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%2C pseudogene%3B;translation=makpykrgtyiiyfkccg#mek#kckwintylye+t+rs#iyil#klflffsnnatnnihiyitifcyttrkwrevvllvpkkq*cksqnsfnrrrskkrmvfsgltaqahkcqynkggqgngl#iniciidkekhtndkreygkgddkyhrpctgkgtgq#krfeigtpwetkkddvnqnqqnvllpprrrhmctsnlenlnadseglsgnhvsdsllgdvlltakyegyt#knnlsndvsgictvm#ysfadfrdiikgtdlwdqskdaerlqenlktifgkikgtigakyarddppytnlrqnwwevmkcripdlravpdkqgylrhkfecyrkyigllilweiqnmfeiiyipelt#ltih#vlnimlifmmkflkenelygtnntknttfnsfskqshsdpimnqlnifhkwiddieicakskndnerlaklkeewenethsgnthpsesnktlntdvsiqihmdnpkpinqfnnmdtiledldkynepyydvqddiyydvndhdtstvdsnnmdvpskvqiemdvntklvkekypiadvwdi
