Pf3D7_01_v3	chado	mRNA	81765	83106	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0101600.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:10430943,PMID:2842673,PMID:25751816,PMID:17719658,PMID:10562315;Parent=PF3D7_0101600;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0101600,UniProtKB:Q8I2C1;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020036,GO:0020003;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 350-369%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-370%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-326%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040500 link%3DPF3D7_1040500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300800 link%3DPF3D7_0300800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223200 link%3DPF3D7_0223200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1301000 link%3DPF3D7_1301000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1301000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0101000 link%3DPF3D7_0101000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0101000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000400 link%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400500 link%3DPF3D7_0400500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0400500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400900 link%3DPF3D7_0400900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3