Pf3D7_01_v3	chado	mRNA	87203	88177	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0101800.1;comment=stevor (subtelomeric%2C variable open reading frames) genes were originally identified as multicopy markers for fingerprinting parasites. With approximately 30 copies per haploid genome%2C they encode the STEVOR proteins%2C which are clonally variant%2C expressed on both merozoites and at the surface of infected erythrocytes. STEVOR is expressed much more prevalently in patient isolates than in laboratory isolates. Similar to (but clearly distinct from) RIFINs%2C surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:18474651,PMID:25011110,PMID:1706114,PMID:14747138,PMID:19229319;Parent=PF3D7_0101800;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0101800,UniProtKB:Q8I2C0;Ontology_term=GO:0016020,GO:0020036,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 198-217%3B,%3Bquery 273-289%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-290%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-174%3B,%3Bquery 241-249%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0221400 link%3DPF3D7_0221400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0221400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1479500 link%3DPF3D7_1479500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1479500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Preichenowi:PRCDC_0047300 link%3DPRCDC_0047300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0729000 link%3DPRCDC_0729000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0832900 link%3DPF3D7_0832900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0031300 link%3DPRCDC_0031300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324600 link%3DPF3D7_0324600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1038700 link%3DPRCDC_1038700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0015600 link%3DPRCDC_0015600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0300100 link%3DPRCDC_0300100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0631900 link%3DPF3D7_0631900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodi