Pf3D7_01_v3	chado	mRNA	303437	311928	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0107500.1;comment=PF3D7_0107500 is associated with drug-resistance. Five different single nucleotide variants were found in clones resistant to MMV028038%2C MMV019662%2C and MMV009108. In addition 12 amplification events were found surrounding this gene in clones resistant to MMV028038 and MMV019662 (PMID:29326268). PfNCR1 is important for asexual parasite viability. Knockdown of PF3D7_0107500 hypersensitizes parasites to saponin. PfNCR1 activity is required for digestive vacuole function (PMID:30888318).;literature=PMID:30888318,PMID:22174676,PMID:15774027;Parent=PF3D7_0107500;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0107500,RMgm:PF3D7_0107500,OPI:PFA0375c,UniProtKB:Q8I266;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 1455-1455%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D1.2470001;Ontology_term=GO:0042493,GO:0016021,GO:0055088,GO:0005886,GO:0042493;controlled_curation=term%3Dknockdown phenotype: essential%3Bcv%3DCC_genedb_controlledcuration%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:30888318%3Bdate%3D20190320%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Mutant Phenotype;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 57-496%3B,%3Bquery 552-562%3B,%3Bquery 623-628%3B,%3Bquery 1099-1312%3B,%3Bquery 1362-1367%3B,%3Bquery 1433-1443%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-1471%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-36%3B,%3Bquery 520-528%3B,%3Bquery 586-599%3B,%3Bquery 652-1078%3B,%3Bquery 1336-1338%3B,%3Bquery 1391-1409%3B,%3Bquery 1467-1470%3B;orthologous_to=Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00103600 link%3DPGAL8A_00103600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_02016300 link%3DPmUG01_02016300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0209500 link%3DPRELSG_0209500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_0207300 link%3DPY17X_0207300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0204300 link%3DPCHAS_0204300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0105400 link%3DPRCDC_0105400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_02014600 link%3DPocGH01_02014600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PB