Pf3D7_01_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	554057	555439	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0114400.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788,PMID:7606775,PMID:6374009;Parent=PF3D7_0114400;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0114400;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-88%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-460%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 107-456%3B;orthologous_to=PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0113200 link%3DPFIT_0113200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0113200.1:pep -> PF3D7_0114400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,,Preichenowi:PRCDC_0112600 link%3DPRCDC_0112600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (EMP1)%2C exon 2%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL6151%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%2C pseudogene%3B;transmembrane_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 89-106%3B;translation=rnpncqqfvpnileipkgnydipktkssnryipycsrskrwldtatiykgktyiyvegdqsddysyigdislsdkis#eskyeqmdindiyiyiyiyiyiyihinhqnikl#fkffwnqqkgihliyqvvthtpinlqmmirin#
