Pf3D7_01_v3	chado	mRNA	557700	558946	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0114500.1;comment=This is a member of the exportome reported by Sargeant et al in hypothetical family 10 (2 members) which is highly expressed in vivo. EST support 5'UTR. Small ORF with two predicted exons and a predicted signal peptide on the first exon followed by a PEXEL erythrocyte trafficking motif on the second exon.  Possible paralogs%2C PFB0070w%3B MAL13P1.61%3B and PF14_0014.  Might be a truncated version of a PEXEL containing gene.;literature=PMID:18325124,PMID:16507167;Parent=PF3D7_0114500;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0114500,UniProtKB:Q8I2D5;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 85-85%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D2.4940002;Ontology_term=GO:0016020,GO:0016021,GO:0043657;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 27-110%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-111%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-3%3B;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0112700 link%3DPRCDC_0112700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3DPlasmodium exported protein (hyp10)%2C unknown function%3B match_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL6150%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3DPlasmodium exported protein (hyp10)%2C unknown function%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:16507167%3Bevidence%3Dinferred from Reviewed Computational Analysis;signal_peptide=signalp%3B%3Bquery 1-24%3Bcleavage_site_probability%3D0.252;transmembrane_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 4-26%3B;translation=msfyyfklsfisillciliithkfsleqithnksnnfniinvthrrllaephkshilkthkgensmaqpivnklrenhtecpkksssiklkkililvslftlpcsffcfq
