Pf3D7_01_v3	chado	mRNA	563703	564842	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0114700.1;comment=B-type rifin (PMID:18197962) rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:10430943,PMID:10562315,PMID:17719658,PMID:2842673;Parent=PF3D7_0114700;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0114700,UniProtKB:Q8I2D4;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 297-297%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.103199996;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0016020,GO:0020033;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 316-323%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-324%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-292%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223100 link%3DPF3D7_0223100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0113500 link%3DPFIT_0113500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Drifin%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0113500.1:pep -> PF3D7_0114700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Preichenowi:PRCDC_0014300 link%3DPRCDC_0014300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Drifin%3B match_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL6149%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1400200 link%3DPF3D7_1400200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1400200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732300 link%3DPF3D7_0732300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0732300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF02009.12%3B%3BE()%3D5.8E-78%3Bscore%3D262.8%3Bquery 26-322%3Bdescription%3DRifin_STEVOR,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR006373 :%09Variant surface antigen Rifin%2C Plasmodium falciparum%3BTIGR_TIGRFAMS:TIGR01477%3B%3Bscore%3D3.9E-95%3Bquery 1-322%3Bdescription%3DVariant surface antig