Pf3D7_01_v3	chado	mRNA	604162	605531	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0115600.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:25751816,PMID:2842673,PMID:17719658,PMID:10562315,PMID:10430943;Parent=PF3D7_0115600;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0115600,UniProtKB:Q8I2C5;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020036,GO:0020003;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 360-379%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-380%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-336%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300200 link%3DPF3D7_1300200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1300200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1373400 link%3DPF3D7_1373400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1373400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1041200 link%3DPF3D7_1041200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1041200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732400 link%3DPF3D7_0732400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0732400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300200 link%3DPF3D7_0300200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115300 link%3DPF3D7_0115300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0115300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040500 link%3DPF3D7_1040500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400500 link%3DPF3D7_0400500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3