Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	mRNA	33030	34259	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0200200.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:2842673,PMID:10430943,PMID:25751816,PMID:10562315,PMID:17719658;Parent=PF3D7_0200200;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O96109,MPMP:PF3D7_0200200;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 296-296%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.103199996;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020036,GO:0020003;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 315-334%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-335%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-291%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1400300 link%3DPF3D7_1400300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1400300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000400 link%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800500 link%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0100200 link%3DPF3D7_0100200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0100200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0222700 link%3DPF3D7_0222700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0222700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1372700 link%3DPF3D7_1372700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1372700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1480000 link%3DPF3D7_1480000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1480000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115200