Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	mRNA	38287	39303	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0200400.1;comment=stevor (subtelomeric%2C variable open reading frames) genes were originally identified as multicopy markers for fingerprinting parasites. With approximately 30 copies per haploid genome%2C they encode the STEVOR proteins%2C which are clonally variant%2C expressed on both merozoites and at the surface of infected erythrocytes. STEVOR is expressed much more prevalently in patient isolates than in laboratory isolates. Similar to (but clearly distinct from) RIFINs%2C surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:14747138,PMID:18474651,PMID:1706114,PMID:19229319,PMID:25011110;Parent=PF3D7_0200400;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O96111,MPMP:PF3D7_0200400;Ontology_term=GO:0016020,GO:0020036,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-181%3B,%3Bquery 288-304%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-305%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 202-264%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1254300 link%3DPF3D7_1254300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1254300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300900 link%3DPF3D7_0300900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040200 link%3DPF3D7_1040200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0049000 link%3DPRCDC_0049000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1479900 link%3DPF3D7_1479900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0301600 link%3DPRCDC_0301600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0053800 link%3DPRCDC_0053800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115400 link%3DPF3D7_0115400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0201300 link%3DPF3D7_0201300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL4881%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0101800 link%3DPF3D7_0101800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0101800.1:p