Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	mRNA	48923	50147	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0200700.1;comment=A-type rifin (PMID:18197962) rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:2842673,PMID:25751816,PMID:17719658,PMID:10562315,PMID:10430943;Parent=PF3D7_0200700;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O96114,MPMP:PF3D7_0200700;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020036,GO:0020003;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 311-330%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-331%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-287%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040600 link%3DPF3D7_1040600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0100200 link%3DPF3D7_0100200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0100200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040000 link%3DPF3D7_1040000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1041100 link%3DPF3D7_1041100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1041100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300800 link%3DPF3D7_0300800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Preichenowi:PRCDC_0027400 link%3DPRCDC_0027400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0055200 link%3DPRCDC_0055200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0021700 link%3DPRCDC_0021700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0002100 link%3DPRCDC_0002100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0052600 link%3DPRCDC_0052600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3D