Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	mRNA	63157	64376	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0201200.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:17719658,PMID:10562315,PMID:10430943,PMID:2842673,PMID:25751816;Parent=PF3D7_0201200;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O96117,MPMP:PF3D7_0201200;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020036,GO:0020003;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 337-356%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-357%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-313%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808800 link%3DPF3D7_0808800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0808800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040600 link%3DPF3D7_1040600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040400 link%3DPF3D7_1040400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1373300 link%3DPF3D7_1373300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1373300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400700 link%3DPF3D7_0400700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0400700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000300 link%3DPF3D7_1000300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1372700 link%3DPF3D7_1372700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1372700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732700 link%3DPF3D7_0732700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7