Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	mRNA	380935	384245	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0209100.1;comment=PF3D7_0209100 plays a role in dynamic relocalization of PfPLP2-containing vesicles to the periphery of gametocytes during egress. PF3D7_0209100 inhibits transmission of P. falciparum in mosquitoes (PMID:31413195). Parasites lacking PF3D7_0209100 were impaired in gametocyte induction%2C while overexpression promotes gametocyte formation. The loss of PF3D7_0209100 further leads to transcriptional downregulation of genes related to gametocytogenesis (PMID:31734953).;literature=PMID:29090840,PMID:31734953,PMID:31413195;Parent=PF3D7_0209100;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O96176,MPMP:PF3D7_0209100,EC:3.1.1.4;Ontology_term=GO:0006629,GO:0005829,GO:0004623,GO:0006644,GO:0044007,GO:0005829;eupathdb_uc=100151633;orthologous_to=,Pmalariae:PmUG01_04023000 link%3DPmUG01_04023000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0412000 link%3DPKNH_0412000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0308400 link%3DPCHAS_0308400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00015900 link%3DPGAL8A_00015900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0415700 link%3DPVP01_0415700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_04020900 link%3DPocGH01_04020900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_0306800 link%3DPY17X_0306800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0413500 link%3DPRELSG_0413500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_0306200 link%3DPBANKA_0306200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0208000 link%3DPRCDC_0208000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL4355%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF01734.18%3B%3BE()%3D1.6E-17%3Bscore%3D64.2%3Bquery 338-544%3Bdescription%3DPatatin,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR016035 :%09Acyl transferase/acyl hydrolase/lysophospholipase%3BSuperfamily:SSF52151%3B%3Bscore%3D1.83E-40%3Bquery 332-673%3Bdescription%3DAcyl transferase/acyl hydrolase/lysophospholipase,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR002641 :%09Pata