Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	873917	875178	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0221900.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7606775,PMID:11544371,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722,PMID:6374009;Parent=PF3D7_0221900;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0221900;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0101500 link%3DPF3D7_0101500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0601400 link%3DPF3D7_0601400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1039400 link%3DPF3D7_1039400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0323900 link%3DPF3D7_0323900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0323200 link%3DPRCDC_0323200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0631200 link%3DPF3D7_0631200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL4933%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0221300 link%3DPFIT_0221300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0221300.1:pep -> PF3D7_0221900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B;translation=vniciidkekhtndkreygkgddkyhrpctgkgtgq#krfeigtpwetkkddvnqnhqnvllpplrrhmstsnmenlnvdseglsgnhvsdlllddvlltakyegeyikknlsndvsgictvmkysfadlrdiikgtdlwdqnndakrlqenfkiiygkikgtlgakyarddppytnlrqnwweamkcripelravpdkqgylrhklecs*ninsttnimgnpkyv*nniytgidlinnslstnhnvdiydevlkrkemnylvqiiqkirllivfpnnhivilmnqlnlfhkwldrhrdmceklnhnehmlnklneewtmdhnenilnihphqllmifiklmmk