Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	901494	902853	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0222900.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:7606788,PMID:7606775,PMID:6374009,PMID:18785843,PMID:11544371;Parent=PF3D7_0222900;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0222900;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 69-69%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D2.1199;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-8%3B,%3Bquery 49-193%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-452%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 27-30%3B,%3Bquery 217-448%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1219300 link%3DPF3D7_1219300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1219300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223300 link%3DPF3D7_0223300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000900 link%3DPF3D7_1000900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808700 link%3DPF3D7_0808700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0808700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100100 link%3DPF3D7_1100100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1100100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1039400 link%3DPF3D7_103940