Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	mRNA	904551	905775	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0223100.1;comment=A-type rifin (PMID:18197962) Binds to leucocyte immunoglobulin-like receptor B1 (LILRB1) and inhibits activation of LILRB1-expressing B cells and natural killer cells (PMID:29187532). rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:10562315,PMID:17719658,PMID:2842673,PMID:25751816,PMID:10430943,PMID:29187532;Parent=PF3D7_0223100;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O96292,MPMP:PF3D7_0223100;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0046789,GO:0020012;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 28-141%3B,%3Bquery 311-330%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-331%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-4%3B,%3Bquery 165-287%3B;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0042600 link%3DPRCDC_0042600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0061500 link%3DPRCDC_0061500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0100200 link%3DPF3D7_0100200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300200 link%3DPF3D7_0300200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0047900 link%3DPRCDC_0047900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0701100 link%3DPF3D7_0701100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0034200 link%3DPRCDC_0034200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0061100 link%3DPRCDC_0061100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800400 link%3DPF3D7_0800400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400900 link%3DPF3D7_0400900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0017900 link%3DPRCDC_0017900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC