Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	mRNA	909350	911054	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0223300.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:6374009,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606788,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606775,PMID:18785843;Parent=PF3D7_0223300;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O96294,MPMP:PF3D7_0223300;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 416-416%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.76;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900100 link%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1240400 link%3DPF3D7_1240400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410300 link%3DPRCDC_0410300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0039900 link%3DPRCDC_0039900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0420700 link%3DPF3D7_0420700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0031700 link%3DPRCDC_0031700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800300 link%3DPF3D7_0800300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0808400 link%3DPRCDC_0808400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0036900 link%3DPRCDC_0036900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0037700 link%3DPRCDC_0037700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600400 link%3DPF3D7_0600400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732800 link%3DPF3D7_0732800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0043100 link%3DPRCDC_0043100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCD