Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	mRNA	913244	914457	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0223400.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:10430943,PMID:2842673,PMID:25751816,PMID:10562315,PMID:17719658;Parent=PF3D7_0223400;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O96295,MPMP:PF3D7_0223400;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020036,GO:0020003;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 308-327%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-328%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-284%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300500 link%3DPF3D7_0300500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800500 link%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0401000 link%3DPF3D7_0401000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0401000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1041100 link%3DPF3D7_1041100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1041100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Preichenowi:PRCDC_0035300 link%3DPRCDC_0035300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0425900 link%3DPF3D7_0425900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL5422%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000300 link%3DPF3D7_1000300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1150300 link%3DPF3D7_1150300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1150300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000200 link%3DP