Pf3D7_02_v3	chado	mRNA	916352	923648	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0223500.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.16-CIDRa3.4-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:7606775,PMID:7606788,PMID:11544371,PMID:7541722,PMID:6374009;Parent=PF3D7_0223500;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O96296,MPMP:PF3D7_0223500;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2146-2146%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.342;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1240400 link%3DPF3D7_1240400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410300 link%3DPRCDC_0410300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0039900 link%3DPRCDC_0039900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0420700 link%3DPF3D7_0420700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0031700 link%3DPRCDC_0031700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800300 link%3DPF3D7_0800300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0808400 link%3DPRCDC_0808400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0036900 link%3DPRCDC_0036900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0037700 link%3DPRCDC_0037700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600400 link%3DPF3D7_0600400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732800 link%3DPF3D7_0732800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0043100 link%3DPRCDC_0043100.1:pep type%3Dortho