Pf3D7_03_v3	chado	mRNA	36965	44482	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0300100.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.9-CIDRa2.4-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:6374009,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606788;Parent=PF3D7_0300100;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O97324,MPMP:PF3D7_0300100,OPI:PFC0005w;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2177-2177%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.51600003;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0009405,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732800 link%3DPF3D7_0732800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410900 link%3DPRCDC_0410900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0001700 link%3DPRCDC_0001700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0037300 link%3DPRCDC_0037300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100200 link%3DPF3D7_1100200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0036900 link%3DPRCDC_0036900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003500 link%3DPRCDC_0003500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0048800 link%3DPRCDC_0048800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1041300 link%3DPF3D7_1041300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0045200 link%3DPRCDC_0045200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0700100 link%3DPRCDC_0700100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0007900 link%3DPRCDC_0007900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1: