Pf3D7_03_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	125687	130112	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0302300.1;comment=Pseudo-VAR gene:heavily frame-shifted genomic region with patchy similarity to PfEMP1 var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775,PMID:6374009,PMID:11544371,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788;Parent=PF3D7_0302300;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0302300;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 1601-1601%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.24939999;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 306-325%3B,%3Bquery 1033-1090%3B,%3Bquery 1284-1294%3B,%3Bquery 1600-1618%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 306-1719%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 346-1014%3B,%3Bquery 1111-1260%3B,%3Bquery 1318-1577%3B,%3Bquery 1637-1640%3B;orthologous_to=PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0302200 link%3DPFIT_0302200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0302200.1:pep -> PF3D7_0302300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B;transmembrane_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 326-345%3B,%3Bquery 1015-1032%3B,%3Bquery 1091-1110%3B,%3Bquery 1261-1283%3B,%3Bquery 1295-1317%3B,%3Bquery 1578-1599%3B,%3Bquery 1619-1636%3B;#eckckqykacdivkeklkysygqtgidgcnkkgpfvwncdntidssyngvcmpprrqklfiynltdtdqrat##ndktwinvnliydneqnipsfniysnsmyenkyymnirnifydyindnictivkry
