Pf3D7_03_v3	chado	mRNA	616472	622816	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0315200.1;comment=Large micronemal protein within the TRAP/MIC-2 superfamily.  CTRP has a predicted domain architecture of a signal peptide followed by six vWA domains%2C followed by an array of seven TSP1-like domains.  Similar to the TRAP/MIC-2 superfamily this protein has a COOH terminal transmembrane domain and a short cytoplasmic domain having an acidic character and a penultimate conserved tryptophan residue. Possible rhomboid protease cleavage site adjacent the external face of the transmembrane domain. Protein essential to ookinete motility and invasion of the mosquito midgut epithelium%2C as evidenced by P.berghei knockouts.;literature=PMID:8719155,PMID:10760158,PMID:10562534,PMID:19633296;Parent=PF3D7_0315200;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O97267,MPMP:PF3D7_0315200,RMgm:PF3D7_0315200;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2092-2092%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.9366999;Ontology_term=GO:0030260,GO:0002312,GO:0043395,GO:0034235,GO:0020009;orthologous_to=,Pyoelii:PY17X_0415800 link%3DPY17X_0415800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_08033300 link%3DPocGH01_08033300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00401100 link%3DPGAL8A_00401100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_0412900 link%3DPBANKA_0412900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0409600 link%3DPRELSG_0409600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_08040900 link%3DPmUG01_08040900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0826900 link%3DPKNH_0826900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0314500 link%3DPRCDC_0314500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0824900 link%3DPVP01_0824900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0413800 link%3DPCHAS_0413800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL4148%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF00090.15%3B%3BE()%3D4.9E-10%3Bscore%3D39.3%3Bquery 1599-1645%3Bdescription%3DTSP_1,pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF00