Pf3D7_03_v3	chado	mRNA	865014	866420	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0320700.1;comment=PF3D7_0320700 is a a non-catalytic component of the signal peptidase complex. SPC25 is essential for growth of P. falciparum in erythrocytes. It is important for the import of PEXEL proteins into the ER. SPC25 knockdown had no effect on the export of PNEPs (PEXEL-negative exported proteins (PMID:30127496)).;literature=PMID:18054093,PMID:30127496;Parent=PF3D7_0320700;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0320700,RMgm:PF3D7_0320700,UniProtKB:Q9NFA0;Ontology_term=GO:0006465,GO:0005515,GO:0005783,GO:0045047,GO:0005787,GO:0008233,GO:0016021;controlled_curation=term%3Dknockdown phenotype: essential for growth in erythrocytes%3Bcv%3DCC_genedb_controlledcuration%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:30127496%3Bdate%3D20180829%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Mutant Phenotype;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-51%3B,%3Bquery 99-179%3B;eupathdb_uc=103340;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-180%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 72-75%3B;orthologous_to=Povale:PocGH01_08027800 link%3DPocGH01_08027800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_1218500 link%3DPCHAS_1218500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0320000 link%3DPRCDC_0320000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00395600 link%3DPGAL8A_00395600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_1221000 link%3DPY17X_1221000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_08035400 link%3DPmUG01_08035400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0820100 link%3DPKNH_0820100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0819500 link%3DPVP01_0819500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_1217800 link%3DPBANKA_1217800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0817400 link%3DPRELSG_0817400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL1813%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF06703.7%3B%3BE()%3D2.0E-12%3Bscore%3D47.1%3Bquery 23-168%3Bdescription%3DSPC25,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR009582 :%09M