Pf3D7_03_v3	chado	mRNA	1027571	1028929	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0324800.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:25751816,PMID:10562315,PMID:10430943,PMID:17719658,PMID:2842673;Parent=PF3D7_0324800;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O97311,MPMP:PF3D7_0324800;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020036,GO:0020003;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 352-371%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-372%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-328%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1254400 link%3DPF3D7_1254400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1373400 link%3DPF3D7_1373400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900700 link%3DPF3D7_0900700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200200 link%3DPF3D7_0200200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1041000 link%3DPF3D7_1041000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0632400 link%3DPF3D7_0632400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000200 link%3DPF3D7_1000200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0937700 link%3DPF3D7_0937700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL4734%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000400 link%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300700 link%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732300 link%3DPF3D7_0732300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0732300.1: