Pf3D7_03_v3	chado	mRNA	1030822	1038254	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0324900.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.9-CIDRa2.1-DBLd1-CIDRb7-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606788,PMID:6374009,PMID:11544371,PMID:18785843;Parent=PF3D7_0324900;Dbxref=UniProtKB:O97312,MPMP:PF3D7_0324900,OPI:PFC1120c;Ontology_term=GO:0016021,GO:0009405,GO:0046789;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732800 link%3DPF3D7_0732800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410900 link%3DPRCDC_0410900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0001700 link%3DPRCDC_0001700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0037300 link%3DPRCDC_0037300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100200 link%3DPF3D7_1100200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0036900 link%3DPRCDC_0036900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003500 link%3DPRCDC_0003500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0048800 link%3DPRCDC_0048800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1041300 link%3DPF3D7_1041300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0045200 link%3DPRCDC_0045200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0700100 link%3DPRCDC_0700100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0007900 link%3DPRCDC_0007900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0006900 link%3DPRCDC_0006900.1:p