Pf3D7_04_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	612798	614069	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0413400.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors similar sequence region present in P. falciparum (Ghana and IT%2C including putative pseudogene PFD0650w)%2C but not in P. reichenowi%3B no EST data available.;literature=PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606775,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:7541722;Parent=PF3D7_0413400;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0413400;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 396-396%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.59159994;orthologous_to=PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0411900 link%3DPFIT_0411900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 1%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0411900.1:pep -> PF3D7_0413400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 1%2C pseudogene%3B;translation=mpprrhelcisnirklgtahvskfnsdklfletmlaakqqtwrlrnrkhegrpwsrnvcrdiqfifydfrdiiqgtdkskdaysvdgernlkaifqqirdqrtqngdtsyndstdtmdglgqvrsdwwgknknkiweafhcgtrdkphemvvyhrivapnfydn#lnnhnmfvgktkrelnqtcqnkfegaisvdnnvniycknkldeyrnwdvhrknqwdgskenykkhkenngfsgkqpneqntkayvkkkkkkkckechcdinnlenmhkklenadlntiktivqevktkknytctitkkknenhpikffenfvenvtrmakiavnqihpnpkelvanllekivcgtmdvaarinkartdiqkqkknqhvrphtcstsitsspekndhpghmcgsgndiwnilipcnntcvfffmlmyp
