Pf3D7_04_v3	chado	mRNA	658117	659834	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0414600.1;comment=APH is present on the microneme surface in Toxoplasma. It senses phosphatidic acid during microneme secretion and is necessary for microneme exocytosis (PMID:26962945). The gene has also been named ICAP1 (indispensable conserved apicomplexan protein) in T. gondii (PMID:27594426). TgAPH is acylated on the surface of the micronemes and recruited to phosphatidic acid-enriched membranes (PMID:29910186).;literature=PMID:26962945,PMID:29910186;Parent=PF3D7_0414600;Dbxref=PDB:6F24,MPMP:PF3D7_0414600,RMgm:PF3D7_0414600,UniProtKB:Q8I1U2;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 199-199%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.344;Ontology_term=GO:0020009;orthologous_to=,Pberghei:PBANKA_0716600 link%3DPBANKA_0716600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00088000 link%3DPGAL8A_00088000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_0716800 link%3DPY17X_0716800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_05029100 link%3DPmUG01_05029100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0725700 link%3DPCHAS_0725700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_05026700 link%3DPocGH01_05026700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0521100 link%3DPVP01_0521100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0506200 link%3DPKNH_0506200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0412100 link%3DPRCDC_0412100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0509800 link%3DPRELSG_0509800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL3545%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF00169.25%3B%3BE()%3D2.2E-6%3Bscore%3D28.0%3Bquery 156-227%3Bdescription%3DPH,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR001849 :%09Pleckstrin-like%3BPfam:PF00169%3B%3Bscore%3D2.0E-6%3Bquery 156-227%3Bdescription%3DPleckstrin homology domain,iprscan%3BSuperfamily:SSF50729%3B%3Bscore%3D2.39E-8%3Bquery 155-228%3Bdescription%3Dnull;product=term%3Dacylated pleckstrin-homology domain-containing protein%2C putative%3B