Pf3D7_04_v3	chado	mRNA	747897	750065	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0417200.1;comment=verified drug target (PMID:6375404%2C PMID:22446744) Dihydrofolate reductase is a target for the antimalarial action of triclosan. Triclosan targets also the liver enzyme enoyl reductase (PF3D7_0615100). This makes triclosan a candidate as a dual specificity antimalarial%2C which could target both liver and blood stages (PMID:29348637).;literature=PMID:12704428,PMID:2825189,PMID:25418308,PMID:29348637,PMID:24716467;Parent=PF3D7_0417200;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0417200,RMgm:PF3D7_0417200,UniProtKB:Q8I1R6,EC:2.1.1.45,EC:1.5.1.3;Ontology_term=GO:0042493,GO:0005737,GO:0003723,GO:0004799,GO:0004146,GO:0006545,GO:0006231,GO:0042493,GO:0042493,GO:0055114,GO:0046654,GO:0006730;orthologous_to=,Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00090700 link%3DPGAL8A_00090700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_05034700 link%3DPmUG01_05034700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0512500 link%3DPRELSG_0512500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_0719300 link%3DPBANKA_0719300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0509600 link%3DPKNH_0509600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_0719300 link%3DPY17X_0719300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0414700 link%3DPRCDC_0414700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0526600 link%3DPVP01_0526600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_05028400 link%3DPocGH01_05028400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0728300 link%3DPCHAS_0728300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL3523%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF00303.15%3B%3BE()%3D4.4E-106%3Bscore%3D353.7%3Bquery 327-607%3Bdescription%3DThymidylat_synt,pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF00186.15%3B%3BE()%3D4.5E-24%3Bscore%3D84.8%3Bquery 99-228%3Bdescription%3DDHFR_1,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR036926 :%09Thymidylate synthase/dCMP hydroxymethylase superfamily%3BSuperfamily:SSF55831%3B%3Bscore%3D2.22E-131%3Bquery 288-607%3Bdescription%