Pf3D7_04_v3	chado	mRNA	946169	953773	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0420900.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.1-CIDRa3.2-DBLd1-CIDRg11-ATSB19 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:11544371,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722,PMID:18785843,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775;Parent=PF3D7_0420900;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0420900,OPI:PFD1000c,UniProtKB:Q8IFQ5;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0016021,GO:0046789;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600600 link%3DPF3D7_0600600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0016700 link%3DPRCDC_0016700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0026700 link%3DPRCDC_0026700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0041400 link%3DPRCDC_0041400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0301500 link%3DPRCDC_0301500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0006900 link%3DPRCDC_0006900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712300 link%3DPF3D7_0712300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0037500 link%3DPRCDC_0037500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0015400 link%3DPRCDC_0015400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0037300 link%3DPRCDC_0037300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0013200 link%3DPRCDC_0013200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1200100 link%3DPF3D7_1200100.1:pe