Pf3D7_04_v3	chado	mRNA	969031	976591	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0421300.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.24-CIDRa3.4-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB6 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7606788,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371,PMID:18785843;Parent=PF3D7_0421300;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0421300,OPI:PFD1015c,UniProtKB:Q8IFQ2;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0046789,GO:0009405,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000900 link%3DPF3D7_1000900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808700 link%3DPF3D7_0808700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0808700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0222900 link%3DPF3D7_0222900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0222900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808600 link%3DPF3D7_0808600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0808600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732800 link%3DPF3D7_0732800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0732800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dortholog