Pf3D7_04_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	986135	987447	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0421600.1;comment=VAR-like fragment var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors pseudogene;literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775,PMID:6374009,PMID:11544371;Parent=PF3D7_0421600;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0421600,OPI:PFD1025w;orthologous_to=PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0419800 link%3DPFIT_0419800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)-like pseudogene%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0419800.1:pep -> PF3D7_0421600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF15445.2%3B%3BE()%3D1.3E-100%3Bscore%3D337.8%3Bquery 1-427%3Bdescription%3DATS,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR029211 :%09Plasmodium falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C acidic terminal segment%3BPfam:PF15445%3B%3Bscore%3D1.3E-100%3Bquery 1-427%3Bdescription%3DPlasmodium falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C acidic terminal segment;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)-like pseudogene%3B;
