Pf3D7_04_v3	chado	mRNA	1156423	1167821	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0425800.1;comment=domain structure: NTSA2-DBLa1.4-CIDRa1.6-DBLb3-DBLb3-DBLg13-DBLd1-CIDRb5-ATSA2 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606788,PMID:11544371;Parent=PF3D7_0425800;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0425800,UniProtKB:Q8I098;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 3538-3538%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.76;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0016021,GO:0046789,GO:0009405;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 3147-3553%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-3554%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-3123%3B;orthologous_to=PfalciparumIT:PFIT_bin00900 link%3DPFIT_bin00900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_bin00900.1:pep -> PF3D7_0425800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600600 link%3DPF3D7_0600600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0016700 link%3DPRCDC_0016700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0026700 link%3DPRCDC_0026700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0041400 link%3DPRCDC_0041400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0301500 link%3DPRCDC_0301500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0006900 link%3DPRCDC_0006900.1:pep type%3Dor