Pf3D7_05_v3	chado	mRNA	20929	28456	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0500100.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.11-CIDRa2.4-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:18785843,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606788,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775;Parent=PF3D7_0500100;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0500100,UniProtKB:Q8I495;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0016021,GO:0046789,GO:0009405;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900100 link%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1219300 link%3DPF3D7_1219300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1219300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_bin07500 link%3DPFIT_bin07500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_bin07500.1:pep -> PF3D7_0500100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000900 link%3DPF3D7_1000900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0221900 link%3DPF3D7_0221900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0221900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1240900 link%3DPF3D7_1240900.1:pep typ