Pf3D7_05_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	29233	29304	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0500200.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:11544371,PMID:7606788,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:18785843,PMID:6374009;Parent=PF3D7_0500200;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0500200,OPI:PFE0010c;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 24-24%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-24%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-3%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400600 link%3DPF3D7_0400600.1:1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0100500 link%3DPF3D7_0100500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL5430%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_bin07400 link%3DPFIT_bin07400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_bin07400.1:pep -> PF3D7_0500200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B;transmembrane_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 4-23%3B;translation=mmsisafplsvgiafaalsyflik
