Pf3D7_05_v3	chado	mRNA	1300188	1302740	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0532100.1;comment=Early transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP) family member.  Plasmodium conserved family with greater than ten members in P. falciparum.  ETRAMPs are abundantly expressed early in the intraerythrocytic cycle and are small (frequently less than 200 aa) integral membrane proteins that are localized within the parasitophorous vacuolar membrane (PVM).  All members have signal peptides plus a transmembrane domain.  Some members are expressed during hepatocyte development and their targeted gene disruption results in a block in hepatocyte development.;literature=PMID:16420351,PMID:2456465,PMID:15580261,PMID:15699336,PMID:12686607,PMID:12615320;Parent=PF3D7_0532100;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0532100,RMgm:PF3D7_0532100,OPI:PFE1590w,UniProtKB:Q8I3F3;Ontology_term=GO:0020005,GO:0005515,GO:0005515;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 135-181%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-182%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-111%3B;orthologous_to=,Preichenowi:PRCDC_0531100 link%3DPRCDC_0531100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Dearly transcribed membrane protein 5%3B match_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL6077%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0535800 link%3DPFIT_0535800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Dearly transcribed membrane protein 5%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0535800.1:pep -> PF3D7_0532100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF09716.6%3B%3BE()%3D3.8E-17%3Bscore%3D62.0%3Bquery 1-138%3Bdescription%3DETRAMP,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR006389 :%09Early transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP)%3BTIGR_TIGRFAMS:TIGR01495%3B%3Bscore%3D7.6E-13%3Bquery 89-141%3Bdescription%3DEarly transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP),iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR006389 :%09Early transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP)%3BPfam:PF09716%3B%3Bscore%3D4.0E-17%3Bquery 1-138%3Bdescription%3DEarly transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP);product=term%3Dearly transcribed membrane protein 5%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:12686607%3Be