Pf3D7_05_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	1322400	1323249	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0532700.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7606775,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:7541722,PMID:6374009;Parent=PF3D7_0532700;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0532700,OPI:PFE1620c;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-153%3B,%3Bquery 205-281%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-283%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 177-185%3B;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0531700 link%3DPRCDC_0531700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (EMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL6072%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_1000300 link%3DPFIT_1000300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_1000300.1:pep -> PF3D7_0532700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B;transmembrane_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 154-176%3B,%3Bquery 186-204%3B;translation=kkskiistrynlfhvinipqkdydiphktstnryipyrsdrykgrtyiyieeeemedynyvgdisssditssseseyeefdindiypykspkyktliemvlnpssktydmkdthidhiedisdtttnkltdnewnklkknfitqylnht#pyvplimsyqmiiciynlifyvliimmknlllqqfkidflivvvkrlliiltgmfrkninrttnimdnpkyvsnniytgiylinysisrnynvdihdemlkrkeyelfrinhtknttfnrvtkqthtnpitn
