Pf3D7_05_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	1333470	1342964	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0533100.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSA1-DBLa1.4-CIDRa1.3-DBLb1-DBLg15-DBLe1-DBLg8-DBLz1-DBLe5 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606775,PMID:6374009;Parent=PF3D7_0533100;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0533100,OPI:PFE1640w;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 3141-3141%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.55099994;Ontology_term=GO:0016021,GO:0009405,GO:0046789;orthologous_to=,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1240900 link%3DPF3D7_1240900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0036500 link%3DPRCDC_0036500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000100 link%3DPF3D7_1000100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0012000 link%3DPRCDC_0012000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0017700 link%3DPRCDC_0017700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200100 link%3DPF3D7_0200100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0700100 link%3DPRCDC_0700100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239900 link%3DPRCDC_1239900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0036100 link%3DPRCDC_0036100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1100100 link%3DPRCDC_1100100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0038700 link%3DPRCDC_0038700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0043100 link%3DPRCDC_0043100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0500100