Pf3D7_06_v3	chado	mRNA	3503	12835	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0600200.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa2-CIDRa1.8-DBLb12-DBLg4-DBLz3-DBLe12-ATSB3 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:6374009,PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606775;Parent=PF3D7_0600200;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C6KSK8,MPMP:PF3D7_0600200,OPI:PFF0010w;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2847-2847%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.51600003;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0046789,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900100 link%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0016700 link%3DPRCDC_0016700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710400 link%3DPRCDC_0710400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300100 link%3DPF3D7_1300100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0012200 link%3DPRCDC_0012200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410300 link%3DPRCDC_0410300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0421300 link%3DPF3D7_0421300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0733000 link%3DPF3D7_0733000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732800 link%3DPF3D7_0732800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0006900 link%3DPRCDC_0006900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0937600 link%3DPF3D7_0937600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0043300 link%3DPRCDC_0