Pf3D7_06_v3	chado	mRNA	17777	23068	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0600400.1;comment=domain structure: NTSA3-DBLa1.3-DBLe8-ATSvar3 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:24759654,PMID:7606775,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722,PMID:18785843;Parent=PF3D7_0600400;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C6KSL0,MPMP:PF3D7_0600400,OPI:PFF0020c;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 1310-1310%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.76;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0009405,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=PfalciparumIT:PFIT_bin02700 link%3DPFIT_bin02700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_bin02700.1:pep -> PF3D7_0600400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900100 link%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0016700 link%3DPRCDC_0016700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710400 link%3DPRCDC_0710400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300100 link%3DPF3D7_1300100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0012200 link%3DPRCDC_0012200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410300 link%3DPRCDC_0410300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0421300 link%3DPF3D7_0421300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0733000 link%3DPF3D7_0733000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732800 link%3DPF3D7_0732800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0006900 link%3DPRCDC_0006900.1:pep type%3Dortholo