Pf3D7_06_v3	chado	mRNA	722377	731499	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0617400.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB1-DBLa0.21-CIDRa2.1-DBLb4-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB17 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775,PMID:7606788,PMID:6374009,PMID:18785843,PMID:11544371;Parent=PF3D7_0617400;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C6KT15,MPMP:PF3D7_0617400,OPI:PFF0845c;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2362-2362%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.152;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0046789,GO:0009405,GO:0016021;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 2047-2394%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-2395%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-2023%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900100 link%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0016700 link%3DPRCDC_0016700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710400 link%3DPRCDC_0710400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300100 link%3DPF3D7_1300100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0012200 link%3DPRCDC_0012200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410300 link%3DPRCDC_0410300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0421300 link%3DPF3D7_0421300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0733000 link%3DPF3D7_0733000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732800 link%3DPF3D7_0732800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0006900 link%3DPRCDC_0006900.1