Pf3D7_06_v3	chado	mRNA	1213102	1217313	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0629500.1;comment=Mutations in PF3D7_0629500 are associated with resistance to three diverse compounds. The carbazoles MMV007224 (-135I inframe insertion)%2C MMV668399 (P380S%2C K238N%2C and V185L)%2C and MMV011895 (F230L). AAT1 may play a role in the efflux of multiple drugs from the digestive vacuole%2C similar to PfCRT (PMID:29326268) Injection of cRNA encoding PF3D7_0629500 into Xenopus laevis oocytes yielded no significant increase in the uptake of arginine%2C nor that of any other amino acid%2C despite the protein being expressed and localised to the oocyte plasma membrane (PMID:26633083).;literature=PMID:26633083,PMID:29410428,PMID:15774027,PMID:29326268;Parent=PF3D7_0629500;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C6KTD0,MPMP:PF3D7_0629500,RMgm:PF3D7_0629500,OPI:PFF1430c;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 572-572%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.152;Ontology_term=GO:0020020,GO:0042493,GO:0005886,GO:0042910;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-172%3B,%3Bquery 222-249%3B,%3Bquery 302-307%3B,%3Bquery 416-427%3B,%3Bquery 568-579%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-607%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 196-198%3B,%3Bquery 273-281%3B,%3Bquery 331-392%3B,%3Bquery 451-544%3B,%3Bquery 603-606%3B;orthologous_to=,Pyoelii:PY17X_1129800 link%3DPY17X_1129800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_1128300 link%3DPBANKA_1128300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_1118800 link%3DPRELSG_1118800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00158000 link%3DPGAL8A_00158000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_1120000 link%3DPVP01_1120000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_1127800 link%3DPCHAS_1127800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_11027800 link%3DPocGH01_11027800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0627900 link%3DPRCDC_0627900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_1120000 link%3DPKNH_1120000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_11034100 