Pf3D7_06_v3	chado	mRNA	1353946	1366430	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0632500.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.6-CIDRa3.2-DBLb5-DBLg13-DBLd4-CIDRg1-DBLe2-DBLe7-DBLe3-ATSB16 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7606788,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:18785843,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775;Parent=PF3D7_0632500;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C6KTF7,MPMP:PF3D7_0632500,OPI:PFF1580c;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 3923-3923%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.342;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0016021,GO:0046789,GO:0009405;controlled_curation=term%3Darginine-methylated protein%3Bcv%3DCC_genedb_controlledcuration%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:27933903%3Bdate%3D20170104%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Direct Assay;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900100 link%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0016700 link%3DPRCDC_0016700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710400 link%3DPRCDC_0710400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300100 link%3DPF3D7_1300100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0012200 link%3DPRCDC_0012200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410300 link%3DPRCDC_0410300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0421300 link%3DPF3D7_0421300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0733000 link%3DPF3D7_0733000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732800 link%3DPF3D7_0732800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C 