Pf3D7_06_v3	chado	mRNA	1371501	1372861	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0632700.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:2842673,PMID:10430943,PMID:25751816,PMID:17719658,PMID:10562315;Parent=PF3D7_0632700;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C6KTF8,MPMP:PF3D7_0632700,OPI:PFF1590w;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020036,GO:0020003;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 357-376%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-377%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-333%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300700 link%3DPF3D7_1300700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0042100 link%3DPRCDC_0042100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0060900 link%3DPRCDC_0060900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1200200 link%3DPF3D7_1200200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003200 link%3DPRCDC_0003200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0055500 link%3DPRCDC_0055500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900200 link%3DPF3D7_0900200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900600 link%3DPF3D7_0900600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410800 link%3DPRCDC_0410800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600300 link%3DPF3D7_0600300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400500 link%3DPF3D7_0400500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0041600 link%3DPRCDC_0041600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0730100 link%3DPRCDC_0730100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115600 link%3DPF3D7_0115600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to