Pf3D7_07_v3	chado	mRNA	20307	28083	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0700100.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.1-CIDRa3.1-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606788,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722;Parent=PF3D7_0700100;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C0H510,MPMP:PF3D7_0700100;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2254-2254%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.51600003;Ontology_term=GO:0016021,GO:0009405,GO:0046789;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0010800 link%3DPRCDC_0010800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1400100 link%3DPF3D7_1400100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600400 link%3DPF3D7_0600400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0001600 link%3DPRCDC_0001600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223500 link%3DPF3D7_0223500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100200 link%3DPF3D7_1100200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0013200 link%3DPRCDC_0013200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800100 link%3DPF3D7_0800100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0007900 link%3DPRCDC_0007900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0617400 link%3DPF3D7_0617400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0017700 link%3DPRCDC_0017700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1100100 link%3DPRCDC_1100100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223300 link%3DPF3D7_0223300.1:pep type%3Dor