Pf3D7_07_v3	chado	mRNA	527338	535131	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0712000.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.17-CIDRa3.1-DBLd1-CIDRg7-ATSB9 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7606788,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:18785843;Parent=PF3D7_0712000;Dbxref=OPI:PF07_0049,MPMP:PF3D7_0712000,UniProtKB:Q8IBX2;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2245-2245%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.152;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0046789,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200800 link%3DPF3D7_0200800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0200800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000900 link%3DPF3D7_1000900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712600 link%3DPF3D7_0712600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0712600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0222900 link%3DPF3D7_0222900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0222900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1219300 link%3DPF3D7_1219300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1