Pf3D7_07_v3	chado	mRNA	581386	588923	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0712800.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.9-CIDRa2.4-DBLd1-CIDRg5-ATSB13 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7606775,PMID:18785843,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371;Parent=PF3D7_0712800;Dbxref=OPI:MAL7P1.55,MPMP:PF3D7_0712800,UniProtKB:Q8IBW8;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0046789,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0010800 link%3DPRCDC_0010800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1400100 link%3DPF3D7_1400100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600400 link%3DPF3D7_0600400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0001600 link%3DPRCDC_0001600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223500 link%3DPF3D7_0223500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100200 link%3DPF3D7_1100200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0013200 link%3DPRCDC_0013200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800100 link%3DPF3D7_0800100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0007900 link%3DPRCDC_0007900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0617400 link%3DPF3D7_0617400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0017700 link%3DPRCDC_0017700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1100100 link%3DPRCDC_1100100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223300 link%3DPF3D7_0223300.1:pe