Pf3D7_07_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	609297	610522	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0713300.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:6374009,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606775,PMID:18785843;Parent=PF3D7_0713300;Dbxref=OPI:MAL7P1.61,MPMP:PF3D7_0713300;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 368-368%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.22039998;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710600 link%3DPRCDC_0710600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (EMP1)%2C exon 2%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL6060%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0711400 link%3DPFIT_0711400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0711400.1:pep -> PF3D7_0713300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF15445.2%3B%3BE()%3D6.2E-105%3Bscore%3D352.0%3Bquery 1-400%3Bdescription%3DATS,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR029211 :%09Plasmodium falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C acidic terminal segment%3BPfam:PF15445%3B%3Bscore%3D6.4E-105%3Bquery 1-400%3Bdescription%3DPlasmodium falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C acidic terminal segment;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B;
