Pf3D7_07_v3	chado	mRNA	970492	971877	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0723100.1;comment=CPH1 (conoid protein hub 1) has been characterised in the Toxoplasma gondii ortholog (TGME49_266630). CPH1 is conserved in apicomplexan parasites%2C contains ankyrin repeats that are required for structural integrity of the conoid%2C parasite motility%2C and host cell invasion. CPH1 is also conserved in Plasmodium that lack a tubulin-rich conoid%2C but instead have an apical polar ring (PMID:29269729).;literature=PMID:29269729;Parent=PF3D7_0723100;Dbxref=OPI:PF07_0096,MPMP:PF3D7_0723100,UniProtKB:Q8IBM2;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 437-437%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.51600003;Ontology_term=GO:0045177;orthologous_to=Povale:PocGH01_03026600 link%3DPocGH01_03026600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_0620600 link%3DPBANKA_0620600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0622300 link%3DPCHAS_0622300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00183600 link%3DPGAL8A_00183600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0720300 link%3DPRCDC_0720300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0318800 link%3DPVP01_0318800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_0623300 link%3DPY17X_0623300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0318500 link%3DPKNH_0318500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0200300 link%3DPRELSG_0200300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_03029500 link%3DPmUG01_03029500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL3711%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,;product=term%3Dprotein CPH1%2C putative%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:29269729%3Bwith%3DUniProt:A0A125YLZ6%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Sequence Orthology;
