Pf3D7_07_v3	chado	mRNA	1385635	1386626	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0732000.1;comment=stevor (subtelomeric%2C variable open reading frames) genes were originally identified as multicopy markers for fingerprinting parasites. With approximately 30 copies per haploid genome%2C they encode the STEVOR proteins%2C which are clonally variant%2C expressed on both merozoites and at the surface of infected erythrocytes. STEVOR is expressed much more prevalently in patient isolates than in laboratory isolates. Similar to (but clearly distinct from) RIFINs%2C surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:19229319,PMID:25011110,PMID:18474651,PMID:14747138,PMID:1706114;Parent=PF3D7_0732000;Dbxref=OPI:PF07_0130,MPMP:PF3D7_0732000,UniProtKB:Q8IBE5;Ontology_term=GO:0016020,GO:0020036,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 24-174%3B,%3Bquery 280-296%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-297%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-3%3B,%3Bquery 198-256%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0901600 link%3DPF3D7_0901600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0901600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0617600 link%3DPF3D7_0617600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0617600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1254300 link%3DPF3D7_1254300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1254300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200400 link%3DPF3D7_0200400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0200400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1254600 link%3DPF3D7_1254600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1254600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0201300 link%3DPF3D7_0201300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0201300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300900 link%3DPF3D7_0300900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Dstevor%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalc