Pf3D7_07_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	1387753	1389037	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0732100.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:6374009,PMID:11544371,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775,PMID:7606788;Parent=PF3D7_0732100;Dbxref=OPI:MAL7P1.183,MPMP:PF3D7_0732100;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 389-389%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.22799999;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 193-204%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-428%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-169%3B,%3Bquery 228-423%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0222900 link%3DPF3D7_0222900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115500 link%3DPF3D7_0115500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300800 link%3DPF3D7_1300800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900800 link%3DPF3D7_0900800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0008200 link%3DPRCDC_0008200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0014800 link%3DPRCDC_0014800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0028700 link%3DPRCDC_0028700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300300 link%3DPF3D7_0300300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0041800 link%3DPRCDC_0041800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0101700 link%3DPF3D7_0101700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324700 link%3DPF3D7_0324700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200300 link%3DPF3D7_0200300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2