Pf3D7_07_v3	chado	mRNA	1390711	1392043	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0732200.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:2842673,PMID:10562315,PMID:10430943,PMID:17719658,PMID:25751816;Parent=PF3D7_0732200;Dbxref=OPI:PF07_0132,MPMP:PF3D7_0732200,UniProtKB:Q8IBE4;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0020035,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 22-140%3B,%3Bquery 347-366%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-367%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-3%3B,%3Bquery 164-323%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0222500 link%3DPF3D7_0222500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0222500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0713000 link%3DPF3D7_0713000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0713000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115200 link%3DPF3D7_0115200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0115200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800500 link%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1041200 link%3DPF3D7_1041200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1041200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0731300 link%3DPFIT_0731300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Drifin%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0731300.1:pep -> PF3D7_0732200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200700 link%3DPF3D7_0200700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0200700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0701800 l