Pf3D7_07_v3	chado	mRNA	1414434	1415683	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0732900.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:2842673,PMID:10562315,PMID:17719658,PMID:10430943,PMID:25751816;Parent=PF3D7_0732900;Dbxref=OPI:PF07_0138,MPMP:PF3D7_0732900,UniProtKB:Q8IBD9;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0020035,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 320-339%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-340%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-296%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0101900 link%3DPF3D7_0101900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0101900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400500 link%3DPF3D7_0400500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0400500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300700 link%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0101000 link%3DPF3D7_0101000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0101000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0222700 link%3DPF3D7_0222700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0222700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223200 link%3DPF3D7_0223200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1301000 link%3DPF3D7_1301000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1301000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732300 link%3DPF3D7_0732300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3D