Pf3D7_08_v3	chado	mRNA	21361	28653	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0800100.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.9-CIDRa2.11-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:6374009,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606775,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722,PMID:18785843;Parent=PF3D7_0800100;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0800100,UniProtKB:Q8IAK1;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2088-2088%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.51600003;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0046789,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1219300 link%3DPF3D7_1219300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1219300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0222900 link%3DPF3D7_0222900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0222900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712600 link%3DPF3D7_0712600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0712600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0632800 link%3DPF3D7_0632800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0632800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0221900 link%3DPF3D7_0221900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0221900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalcipar