Pf3D7_08_v3	chado	mRNA	29147	39682	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0800200.1;comment=domain structure: NTSA5-DBLa1.6-CIDRd2-DBLb6-DBLg14-DBLz5-DBLe4-ATSA3 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:6374009,PMID:11544371,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775;Parent=PF3D7_0800200;Dbxref=OPI:PF08_0141,MPMP:PF3D7_0800200,UniProtKB:Q8IAK2;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2843-2843%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.76;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0005515,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0016021,GO:0046789;orthologous_to=PfalciparumIT:PFIT_1200100 link%3DPFIT_1200100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_1200100.1:pep -> PF3D7_0800200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_bin08900 link%3DPFIT_bin08900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_bin08900.1:pep -> PF3D7_0800200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0533100 link%3DPF3D7_0533100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0733000 link%3DPF3D7_0733000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0002900 link%3DPRCDC_0002900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710400 link%3DPRCDC_0710400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1218600 link%3DPRCDC_1218600.1:pep type%3Dort