Pf3D7_08_v3	chado	mRNA	40302	51425	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0800300.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB5-DBLa2-CIDRa1.6-DBLb12-DBLg4-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788,PMID:7606775,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009;Parent=PF3D7_0800300;Dbxref=OPI:PF08_0140,MPMP:PF3D7_0800300,UniProtKB:Q8IAK3;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2949-2949%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.342;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0016021,GO:0046789;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0533100 link%3DPF3D7_0533100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0733000 link%3DPF3D7_0733000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0002900 link%3DPRCDC_0002900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710400 link%3DPRCDC_0710400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1218600 link%3DPRCDC_1218600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003900 link%3DPRCDC_0003900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1150400 link%3DPF3D7_1150400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1240900 link%3DPF3D7_1240900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0700100 link%3DPRCDC_0700100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0500100 link%3DPF3D7_0500100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400200 link%3DPF3D7_0400