Pf3D7_08_v3	chado	mRNA	430405	439297	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0808600.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.15-CIDRa3.2-DBLd1-CIDRg2-ATSB2 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788,PMID:6374009,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775,PMID:11544371;Parent=PF3D7_0808600;Dbxref=OPI:PF08_0107,MPMP:PF3D7_0808600,UniProtKB:Q8IAS3;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2233-2233%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.51600003;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0016021,GO:0046789,GO:0009405;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100100 link%3DPF3D7_1100100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1100100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800100 link%3DPF3D7_0800100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0800100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712600 link%3DPF3D7_0712600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0712600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0533100 link%3DPF3D7_0533100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0733000 link%3DPF3D7_0733000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0002900 link%3DPRCDC_0002900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710400 link%3DPRCDC_0710400.1:pep type%3Dortholo