Pf3D7_08_v3	chado	mRNA	440408	448062	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0808700.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.2-CIDRa3.1-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB14 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:6374009,PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371;Parent=PF3D7_0808700;Dbxref=OPI:PF08_0106,MPMP:PF3D7_0808700,UniProtKB:Q8IAS4;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0046789,GO:0016021;controlled_curation=term%3Darginine-methylated protein%3Bcv%3DCC_genedb_controlledcuration%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:27933903%3Bdate%3D20170104%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Direct Assay;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0221900 link%3DPF3D7_0221900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0221900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0533100 link%3DPF3D7_0533100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0733000 link%3DPF3D7_0733000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0002900 link%3DPRCDC_0002900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710400 link%3DPRCDC_0710400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1218600 link%3DPRCDC_1218600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003900 link%3DPRCDC_0003900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1150400 link%3DPF3D7_1150400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C 