Pf3D7_08_v3	chado	mRNA	1268752	1270237	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0829600.1;comment=Early transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP) family member.  Plasmodium conserved family with greater than ten members in P. falciparum.  ETRAMPs are abundantly expressed early in the intraerythrocytic cycle and are small (frequently less than 200 aa) integral membrane proteins that are localized within the parasitophorous vacuolar membrane (PVM).  All members have signal peptides plus a transmembrane domain.  Some members are expressed during hepatocyte development and their targeted gene disruption results in a block in hepatocyte development.;literature=PMID:16420351,PMID:12615320,PMID:15580261,PMID:15699336,PMID:12686607;Parent=PF3D7_0829600;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C0H4Z2,OPI:MAL8P1.6,MPMP:PF3D7_0829600;Ontology_term=GO:0020005;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 22-52%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-171%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-3%3B,%3Bquery 76-170%3B;orthologous_to=Pknowlesi:PKNH_1323800 link%3DPKNH_1323800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0828900 link%3DPRCDC_0828900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0504800 link%3DPVP01_0504800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_05016400 link%3DPmUG01_05016400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_05011300 link%3DPocGH01_05011300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL5019%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0832500 link%3DPFIT_0832500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Dearly transcribed membrane protein 8%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0832500.1:pep -> PF3D7_0829600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF09716.6%3B%3BE()%3D1.7E-15%3Bscore%3D56.7%3Bquery 1-77%3Bdescription%3DETRAMP,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR006389 :%09Early transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP)%3BTIGR_TIGRFAMS:TIGR01495%3B%3Bscore%3D1.2E-10%3Bquery 1-80%3Bdescription%3DEarly transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP),iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR00638