Pf3D7_08_v3	chado	mRNA	1373212	1376988	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0831800.1;comment=HRP2%2C which is only expressed by P. falciparum parasites%2C is presently the most widely used RDT (Rapid diagnostic test). Mutations and deletions identified within the PfHRP2 gene in isolates from South America%2C Africa and Asia have however been found to compromise RDT specificity (PMID:24472178%2C PMID:23041541%2C PMID:20111602%2C PMID:16088837).;literature=PMID:25978499,PMID:30459336,PMID:25398028,PMID:8539625,PMID:3016741;Parent=PF3D7_0831800;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C0H4J6,MPMP:PF3D7_0831800;Ontology_term=GO:0020020,GO:0042167,GO:0030430,GO:0005737,GO:0033644,GO:0020036;orthologous_to=PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0834800 link%3DPFIT_0834800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Dhistidine-rich protein II%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0834800.1:pep -> PF3D7_0831800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF05403.7%3B%3BE()%3D9.2E-49%3Bscore%3D166.0%3Bquery 1-117%3Bdescription%3DPlasmodium_HRP,pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF05403.7%3B%3BE()%3D5.1E-37%3Bscore%3D127.7%3Bquery 114-260%3Bdescription%3DPlasmodium_HRP,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR008779 :%09Plasmodium histidine-rich%3BPfam:PF05403%3B%3Bscore%3D9.5E-49%3Bquery 1-117%3Bdescription%3DPlasmodium histidine-rich,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR008779 :%09Plasmodium histidine-rich%3BPfam:PF05403%3B%3Bscore%3D5.2E-37%3Bquery 114-260%3Bdescription%3DPlasmodium histidine-rich;product=term%3Dhistidine-rich protein II%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:8539625%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Direct Assay;
