Pf3D7_08_v3	chado	mRNA	1435794	1443449	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0833500.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.17-CIDRa3.1-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:11544371,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722;Parent=PF3D7_0833500;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C0H4I1,MPMP:PF3D7_0833500;Ontology_term=GO:0016021,GO:0009405,GO:0046789;controlled_curation=term%3Darginine-methylated protein%3Bcv%3DCC_genedb_controlledcuration%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:27933903%3Bdate%3D20170104%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Direct Assay;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0533100 link%3DPF3D7_0533100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0733000 link%3DPF3D7_0733000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0002900 link%3DPRCDC_0002900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710400 link%3DPRCDC_0710400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1218600 link%3DPRCDC_1218600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003900 link%3DPRCDC_0003900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1150400 link%3DPF3D7_1150400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1240900 link%3DPF3D7_1240900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0700100 link%3DPRCDC_0700100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0500100 link%3DPF3D7_0500100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400200 link%3DPF3D7_0400