Pf3D7_09_v3	chado	mRNA	270371	275833	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0905400.1;comment=RhopH3 is part of a multi-protein complex. This multi-protein complex involving Cyclophilin B and Basigin on the RBC surface%2C as well as PfRhopH3 and PfRh5 on the merozoite surface aids invasion (PMID:29146974). RhopH3 plays a central role in the formation of a functional RhopH complex. Mutation of RhopH3 results in ~50%25 decrease in host erythrocyte invasion and in a block in the development in the early trophozoite stage of those parasites that do invade (PMID:28252384).;literature=PMID:29146974,PMID:1775161,PMID:25157665,PMID:28252384;Parent=PF3D7_0905400;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0905400,RMgm:PF3D7_0905400,OPI:PFI0265c,UniProtKB:Q8I395;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 878-878%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D2.4940002;Ontology_term=GO:0020008,GO:0030260,GO:0005515,GO:0005515,GO:0030260,GO:0020030,GO:0046789,GO:0009986,GO:0005515,GO:0005634,GO:1903561,GO:0044877;orthologous_to=,Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00417900 link%3DPGAL8A_00417900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0416900 link%3DPCHAS_0416900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0703100 link%3DPKNH_0703100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_0416000 link%3DPBANKA_0416000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0702600 link%3DPRELSG_0702600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_07012800 link%3DPocGH01_07012800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_0418800 link%3DPY17X_0418800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_07016900 link%3DPmUG01_07016900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0703800 link%3DPVP01_0703800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0903500 link%3DPRCDC_0903500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL4122%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Dhigh molecular weight rhoptry protein 3%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:28252384%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Direct Assay;signal_peptide=signalp%3B%3Bquery 1-25%3Bcleavage_site_probability%3D0.805;
