Pf3D7_09_v3	chado	mRNA	363574	365642	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0907700.1;comment=P28 is the 11S subunit of the proteasome. Enhances the ability of Pf20S to degrade small peptide substrates. Forms a heptameric structure with a charge-segregated pore. Deletion of the PA28 regulator renders malaria parasites more sensitive to the antimalarial drug dihydroartemisinin%2C indicating that PA28 may play a role in protection against proteotoxic stress (PMID:31384003).;literature=PMID:26639022,PMID:31384003;Parent=PF3D7_0907700;Dbxref=PDB:6DFK,MPMP:PF3D7_0907700,RMgm:PF3D7_0907700,OPI:PFI0370c,UniProtKB:Q8I374;Ontology_term=GO:0005634,GO:0008537,GO:0008537,GO:0061136,GO:0061133,GO:0010950,GO:0042493;orthologous_to=Pberghei:PBANKA_0809100 link%3DPBANKA_0809100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0705500 link%3DPKNH_0705500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00420400 link%3DPGAL8A_00420400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0706200 link%3DPVP01_0706200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_0812400 link%3DPY17X_0812400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0705100 link%3DPRELSG_0705100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0809400 link%3DPCHAS_0809400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_07019300 link%3DPmUG01_07019300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_07015200 link%3DPocGH01_07015200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0905800 link%3DPRCDC_0905800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL3413%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF02252.14%3B%3BE()%3D1.2E-55%3Bscore%3D187.0%3Bquery 132-273%3Bdescription%3DPA28_beta,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR003186 :%09Proteasome activator pa28%2C REG beta subunit%3BPfam:PF02252%3B%3Bscore%3D7.6E-56%3Bquery 132-273%3Bdescription%3DProteasome activator PA28%2C C-terminal domain,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR036252 :%09Proteasome activator superfamily%3BSuperfamily:SSF47216%3B%3Bscore%3D1.44E-65%3Bquery 15-270%3Bde