Pf3D7_09_v3	chado	mRNA	1429554	1431890	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0936100.1;comment=Early transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP) family member.  Plasmodium conserved family with greater than ten members in P. falciparum.  ETRAMPs are abundantly expressed early in the intraerythrocytic cycle and are small (frequently less than 200 aa) integral membrane proteins that are localized within the parasitophorous vacuolar membrane (PVM).  All members have signal peptides plus a transmembrane domain.  Some members are expressed during hepatocyte development and their targeted gene disruption results in a block in hepatocyte development.;literature=PMID:15580261,PMID:12686607,PMID:16420351,PMID:15699336,PMID:12615320;Parent=PF3D7_0936100;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0936100,UniProtKB:Q8I2F9;Ontology_term=GO:0020005;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-6%3B,%3Bquery 75-179%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-180%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 30-51%3B;orthologous_to=Povale:PocGH01_07043700 link%3DPocGH01_07043700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0934200 link%3DPRCDC_0934200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0734800 link%3DPVP01_0734800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0734700 link%3DPKNH_0734700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00001300 link%3DPGAL8A_00001300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_07047900 link%3DPmUG01_07047900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL4921%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_0936700 link%3DPFIT_0936700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Dearly transcribed membrane protein%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_0936700.1:pep -> PF3D7_0936100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF09716.6%3B%3BE()%3D6.1E-16%3Bscore%3D58.1%3Bquery 1-79%3Bdescription%3DETRAMP,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR006389 :%09Early transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP)%3BTIGR_TIGRFAMS:TIGR01495%3B%3Bscore%3D6.3E-29%3Bquery 1-84%3Bdescription%3DEar