Pf3D7_09_v3	chado	mRNA	1432339	1435093	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0936200.1;comment=Contains a tryptophan-rich domain that is amplified in P. falciparum and is conserved in Plasmodium.  Predicted paralogs in P. falciparum:  PF11_0041%3B PFA0610c%3B PFB0110w%3B and PF11_0504.  Possible relationship to the tryptophan-rich domain that is repeated in SURFINs and is present in the merozoite-associated tryptophan-rich antigen.  Possible signal peptide sequence encoded on the first exon and possible PEXEL trafficking motif on the second exon.  Two adjacent genes%2C PFI1755c and PFI1760w%2C also encode  tryptophan-rich proteins that are perhaps related.;literature=PMID:16507167;Parent=PF3D7_0936200;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0936200,OPI:PFI1750c,UniProtKB:Q8I2F8;Ontology_term=GO:0043657,GO:0020036;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0934300 link%3DPRCDC_0934300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_07048000 link%3DPmUG01_07048000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0422900 link%3DPVP01_0422900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00190000 link%3DPGAL8A_00190000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL5092%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF09688.6%3B%3BE()%3D2.3E-48%3Bscore%3D163.8%3Bquery 47-185%3Bdescription%3DWx5_PLAF3D7,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR006496 :%09Conserved hypothetical protein CHP01609%2C Plasmodium falciparum 3D7%3BPfam:PF09688%3B%3Bscore%3D2.3E-48%3Bquery 47-185%3Bdescription%3DConserved hypothetical protein CHP01609%2C Plasmodium spp,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR006496 :%09Conserved hypothetical protein CHP01609%2C Plasmodium falciparum 3D7%3BTIGR_TIGRFAMS:TIGR01609%3B%3Bscore%3D1.4E-65%3Bquery 45-186%3Bdescription%3DConserved hypothetical protein CHP01609%2C Plasmodium spp;product=term%3DPlasmodium exported protein (hyp11)%2C unknown function%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:16507167%3Bevidence%3Dinferred from Reviewed Computational Analysis;signal_peptide=signalp%3B%3Bquery 1-22%3Bcleavage_site_probability%3D