Pf3D7_09_v3	chado	mRNA	1486070	1490187	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0937600.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSA3-DBLa1.3-DBLe8-ATSvar3 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7606775,PMID:6374009,PMID:24759654,PMID:11544371,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722;Parent=PF3D7_0937600;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0937600,OPI:PFI1820w,UniProtKB:Q8I2E4;Ontology_term=GO:0016021,GO:0046789,GO:0009405;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003300 link%3DPRCDC_0003300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0043100 link%3DPRCDC_0043100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0711700 link%3DPF3D7_0711700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0301500 link%3DPRCDC_0301500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0001700 link%3DPRCDC_0001700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0024500 link%3DPRCDC_0024500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0420700 link%3DPF3D7_0420700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0425800 link%3DPF3D7_0425800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808600 link%3DPF3D7_0808600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712400 link%3DPF3D7_0712400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0418500 link%3DPRCDC_0418500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900100 link%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0937800 link%3DPF3D7_0937800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0042900 link%3DPRCDC_0042900.1:p