Pf3D7_09_v3	chado	mRNA	1492373	1493708	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_0937700.1;comment=A-type rifin (PMID:18197962) rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:25751816,PMID:10562315,PMID:10430943,PMID:17719658,PMID:2842673;Parent=PF3D7_0937700;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0937700,OPI:PFI1825w,UniProtKB:Q8I082;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0020035,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 348-367%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-368%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-324%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200200 link%3DPF3D7_0200200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0632400 link%3DPF3D7_0632400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900700 link%3DPF3D7_0900700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000200 link%3DPF3D7_1000200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324800 link%3DPF3D7_0324800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1254400 link%3DPF3D7_1254400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1041000 link%3DPF3D7_1041000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1373400 link%3DPF3D7_1373400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL4734%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF02009.12%3B%3BE()%3D1.1E-130%3Bscore%3D436.0%3Bquery 20-367%3Bdescription%3DRifin_STEVOR,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR006373 :%09Variant surface antigen Rifin%2C Plasmodium falciparum%3BTIGR_TIGRFAMS:TIGR01477%3B%3Bscore%3D1.8E-147%3Bquery 1-367%3Bdescription%3DVariant surface antigen Rifin,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR006373 :%09Variant surface antigen Rifin%2C Pl