Pf3D7_09_v3	chado	mRNA	1495579	1503336	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_0937800.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.1-CIDRa3.1-DBLd1-CIDRg5-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:6374009,PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:11544371,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775;Parent=PF3D7_0937800;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_0937800,OPI:PFI1830c,UniProtKB:Q8I2E3;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2232-2232%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.51600003;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0046789,GO:0009405,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003300 link%3DPRCDC_0003300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0043100 link%3DPRCDC_0043100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0711700 link%3DPF3D7_0711700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0301500 link%3DPRCDC_0301500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0001700 link%3DPRCDC_0001700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0024500 link%3DPRCDC_0024500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0420700 link%3DPF3D7_0420700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0425800 link%3DPF3D7_0425800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808600 link%3DPF3D7_0808600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712400 link%3DPF3D7_0712400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0418500 link%3DPRCDC_0418500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900100 link%3DPF3D7_0900100