Pf3D7_10_v3	chado	mRNA	28490	36164	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1000100.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.20-CIDRa3.1-DBLd1-CIDRg4-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606788,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:6374009;Parent=PF3D7_1000100;Dbxref=OPI:PF10_0001,MPMP:PF3D7_1000100,UniProtKB:Q8IK37;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0098609,GO:0016021,GO:0009405;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712000 link%3DPF3D7_0712000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0712000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223300 link%3DPF3D7_0223300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0500100 link%3DPF3D7_0500100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0500100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223500 link%3DPF3D7_0223500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200800 link%3DPF3D7_0200800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0200800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1219300 link%3DPF3D7_1219300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bprodu