Pf3D7_10_v3	chado	mRNA	1432498	1434786	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1036300.1;comment=DBLMSP2 is a merozoite surface protein that belongs to the MSP3-multigene family (PMID:19404387). It is associated with antimalarial drug resistance (PMID:21533027) and variantly expressed in patient samples (PMID:18046333). DBLMSP2 is expressed only in a small subpopulation of schizonts. Gametocyte development protein 1 (GDV1) (PF3D7_0935400) activates the dblmsp2 locus. This suggests that DBLMSP2 may be expressed specifically in sexually committed schizonts (PMID:29590075).;literature=PMID:17159978,PMID:25074930,PMID:23587962,PMID:19404387,PMID:23133397,PMID:27226583,PMID:21533027;Parent=PF3D7_1036300;Dbxref=PDB:3VUU,OPI:PF10_0355,MPMP:PF3D7_1036300,UniProtKB:Q8IJ45;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 745-745%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.172;Ontology_term=GO:0046812,GO:0009986,GO:0042493,GO:0005515,GO:0001791,GO:0046789,GO:0016021,GO:0009405;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-6%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-763%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 30-762%3B;orthologous_to=,Preichenowi:PRCDC_1035400 link%3DPRCDC_1035400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Dduffy binding-like merozoite surface protein 2%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL5981%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_1035500 link%3DPFIT_1035500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Dmerozoite surface protein%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_1035500.1:pep -> PF3D7_1036300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF05424.7%3B%3BE()%3D2.3E-19%3Bscore%3D70.0%3Bquery 201-341%3Bdescription%3DDuffy_binding,pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF07133.7%3B%3BE()%3D7.4E-59%3Bscore%3D198.7%3Bquery 571-762%3Bdescription%3DMerozoite_SPAM,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR010784 :%09Merozoite surface%3BPfam:PF07133%3B%3Bscore%3D7.6E-59%3Bquery 571-762%3Bdescription%3DMerozoite surface protein-type,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR008602 :%09Plasmodium Duffy binding%3BPfam:PF05424%3B%3Bscore%3D2.5E-19%3Bquery 201-341%3Bdescriptio