Pf3D7_10_v3	chado	mRNA	1625772	1626824	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1040800.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. B-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:10430943,PMID:10562315,PMID:17719658,PMID:2842673;Parent=PF3D7_1040800;Dbxref=OPI:PF10_0401,MPMP:PF3D7_1040800,UniProtKB:Q8IJ01;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 265-265%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.15480001;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0016020,GO:0020033;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 289-295%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-296%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-265%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0701300 link%3DPF3D7_0701300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0701300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0100900 link%3DPF3D7_0100900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0100900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732400 link%3DPF3D7_0732400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0732400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324400 link%3DPF3D7_0324400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0324400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1150300 link%3DPF3D7_1150300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1150300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040400 link%3DPF3D7_1040400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100500 link%3DPF3D7_1100500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1100500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300500 link%3DPF3D7_0300500.1:pep type%3