Pf3D7_10_v3	chado	mRNA	1632398	1633665	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1041000.1;comment=A-type rifin (PMID:18197962) rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. Associated with GAGAGAA motif in 5'-untranslated region (PMID:17307259);literature=PMID:25751816,PMID:10430943,PMID:17719658,PMID:10562315,PMID:2842673;Parent=PF3D7_1041000;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_1041000,UniProtKB:Q8IIZ9;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0020035,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 351-370%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-371%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-327%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300800 link%3DPF3D7_0300800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0713000 link%3DPF3D7_0713000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0713000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000300 link%3DPF3D7_1000300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0114700 link%3DPF3D7_0114700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0114700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040700 link%3DPF3D7_1040700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0222500 link%3DPF3D7_0222500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0222500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732300 link%3DPF3D7_0732300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0732300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800500 link%3DPF3D7_0800500.1: