Pf3D7_10_v3	chado	mRNA	1642401	1649948	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1041300.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.9-CIDRa2.7-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7606775,PMID:6374009,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:11544371;Parent=PF3D7_1041300;Dbxref=OPI:PF10_0406,MPMP:PF3D7_1041300,UniProtKB:Q8IIZ6;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2156-2156%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.46799996;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400100 link%3DPF3D7_0400100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0710400 link%3DPRCDC_0710400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0412900 link%3DPF3D7_0412900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0012700 link%3DPRCDC_0012700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0100300 link%3DPF3D7_0100300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0013200 link%3DPRCDC_0013200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1200100 link%3DPF3D7_1200100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300300 link%3DPF3D7_1300300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1400100 link%3DPF3D7_1400100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600200 link%3DPF3D7_0600200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0937600 link%3DPF3D7_0937600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0412700 link%3DPF3D7_041270