Pf3D7_11_v3	chado	mRNA	24160	31598	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1100100.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.15-CIDRa3.2-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB2 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722;Parent=PF3D7_1100100;Dbxref=OPI:PF11_0007,MPMP:PF3D7_1100100,UniProtKB:Q8IIZ5;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0500100 link%3DPF3D7_0500100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0500100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239500 link%3DPRCDC_1239500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600200 link%3DPF3D7_0600200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0420900 link%3DPF3D7_0420900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712800 link%3DPF3D7_0712800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239900 link%3DPRCDC_1239900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712300 link%3DPF3D7_0712300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0042900 link%3DPRCDC_0042900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0413100 link%3DPF3D7_0413100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100200 link%3DPF3D7_1100200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1200600 link%3DPF3D7_1200600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200100 link%3DP