Pf3D7_11_v3	chado	mRNA	32666	42386	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1100200.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSA6-DBLa1.5-CIDRg3-DBLg12-DBLd5-CIDRb4-DBLb9-ATSA2 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775,PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371;Parent=PF3D7_1100200;Dbxref=OPI:PF11_0008,MPMP:PF3D7_1100200,UniProtKB:Q8IIZ4;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2979-2979%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.76;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0098609,GO:0016021,GO:0009405;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 2572-2994%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-2995%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-2548%3B;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239500 link%3DPRCDC_1239500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600200 link%3DPF3D7_0600200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0420900 link%3DPF3D7_0420900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712800 link%3DPF3D7_0712800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239900 link%3DPRCDC_1239900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712300 link%3DPF3D7_0712300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0042900 link%3DPRCDC_0042900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0413100 link%3DPF3D7_0413100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1200600 link%3DPF3D7_1200600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200100 link%3DPF3D7_0200100.