Pf3D7_11_v3	chado	mRNA	66686	67965	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1101100.1;comment=A-type rifin (PMID:18197962) rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:17719658,PMID:10430943,PMID:10562315,PMID:29187532,PMID:2842673,PMID:25751816;Parent=PF3D7_1101100;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_1101100,UniProtKB:Q8IIY5;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0046789;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 330-349%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-350%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-306%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200200 link%3DPF3D7_0200200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0200200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100500 link%3DPF3D7_1100500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1100500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0100200 link%3DPF3D7_0100200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0100200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0114700 link%3DPF3D7_0114700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0114700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100400 link%3DPF3D7_1100400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1100400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200500 link%3DPF3D7_0200500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0200500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400300 link%3DPF3D7_0400300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0400300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300800 link%3DPF3D7_0300800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch