Pf3D7_11_v3	chado	mRNA	240616	245317	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1105600.1;comment=PTEX88 is a component of the PTEX complex (Plasmodium translocon of exported proteins)(PMID:19536257). PTEX consists of PTEX88%2C EXP2 (PF3D7_1471100)%2C PTEX150 (PF3D7_1436300)%2C HSP101 (PF3D7_1116800) and TRX2 (PF3D7_1345100) (PMID:27374802). Knockdown of PTEX88 did not affect the growth of parasites in vitro%2C it is associated with the reduction in cytoadherence (PMID:26886275). PTEX88 is not essential for the export of cysteine-rich substrates across the PVM (parasitophorous vacuole membrane) (PMID:29637707).;literature=PMID:23869529,PMID:29637707,PMID:26886275,PMID:25820521,PMID:19536257;Parent=PF3D7_1105600;Dbxref=OPI:PF11_0067,MPMP:PF3D7_1105600,RMgm:PF3D7_1105600,UniProtKB:Q8IIU7;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 738-738%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D1.72;Ontology_term=GO:0044053,GO:0005515,GO:0005515,GO:0097619,GO:0020005,GO:0020003,GO:0020026;controlled_curation=term%3Ddispensable%3Bcv%3DCC_genedb_controlledcuration%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:26886275%3Bdate%3D20180412%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Mutant Phenotype;orthologous_to=,Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00332900 link%3DPGAL8A_00332900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1104100 link%3DPRCDC_1104100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_09015200 link%3DPmUG01_09015200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_0941300 link%3DPBANKA_0941300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_0943800 link%3DPY17X_0943800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0903200 link%3DPKNH_0903200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0903000 link%3DPCHAS_0903000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_09012300 link%3DPocGH01_09012300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0902800 link%3DPRELSG_0902800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0906400 link%3DPVP01_0906400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL2782%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Dtranslocon component PT