Pf3D7_11_v3	chado	mRNA	635806	641374	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1116800.1;comment=HSP101 localises to the apical complex in free merozoites and the parasitophorous vacuolar membrane in ring stage parasites (PMID:19536257). HSP101 is a core component of the PTEX complex (Plasmodium translocon of exported proteins) (PMID:19536257). PTEX consists of five components%2C HSP101%2C EXP2 (PF3D7_1471100)%2C PTEX150 (PF3D7_1436300)%2C PTEX88 (PF3D7_1105600) and TRX2 (PF3D7_1345100) (PMID:27374802). The structure of the core PTEX complex has been solved by cryo-electron microscopy (PMID: 30150771).;literature=PMID:22253438,PMID:31164473,PMID:26130467,PMID:25043010,PMID:30150771,PMID:23910910,PMID:20887733 PMID:25043043,PMID:19536257;Parent=PF3D7_1116800;Dbxref=PDB:4IOD,PDB:4IRF,OPI:PF11_0175,MPMP:PF3D7_1116800,RMgm:PF3D7_1116800,UniProtKB:Q8IIJ8;Ontology_term=GO:0006986,GO:0009408,GO:0020005,GO:0020007,GO:0020003,GO:0005515,GO:0044053,GO:0005515,GO:0097619,GO:0005515,GO:0005515,GO:0005515,GO:0020026,GO:0097619,GO:0005634,GO:1903561,GO:0005524,GO:0019538,GO:0043335,GO:0020036;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-4%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-907%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 28-906%3B;orthologous_to=Pyoelii:PY17X_0933200 link%3DPY17X_0933200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_0931200 link%3DPBANKA_0931200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0917400 link%3DPVP01_0917400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_09023000 link%3DPocGH01_09023000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0914500 link%3DPKNH_0914500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_09026100 link%3DPmUG01_09026100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0913100 link%3DPCHAS_0913100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00343400 link%3DPGAL8A_00343400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1115200 link%3DPRCDC_1115200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0913600 link%3DPRELSG_0913600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_t