Pf3D7_11_v3	chado	mRNA	986112	988218	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1125100.1;comment=The Toxoplasma gondii ortholog TGME49_231410 has been characterized as ICAP2 (indispensable conserved apicomplexan protein) (PMID:27594426). ICAP2 shares structural homology with bovine and fungal ATP synthase b subunits. A loss of ICAP2 triggers aberrant mitochondrial morphology and affects the function and conformation of the ATP synthase (PMID:30204085).;literature=PMID:30204085,PMID:30005062;Parent=PF3D7_1125100;Dbxref=OPI:PF11_0262,MPMP:PF3D7_1125100,UniProtKB:Q8IIB2;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 459-459%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.172;Ontology_term=GO:0005739,GO:0015986,GO:0000276,GO:0015078;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-184%3B;eupathdb_uc=100061233;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-497%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 208-496%3B;orthologous_to=Pchabaudi:PCHAS_0921200 link%3DPCHAS_0921200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_0925200 link%3DPY17X_0925200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_09031400 link%3DPocGH01_09031400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_09034400 link%3DPmUG01_09034400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00351800 link%3DPGAL8A_00351800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_0923200 link%3DPBANKA_0923200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_0922100 link%3DPRELSG_0922100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_0925800 link%3DPVP01_0925800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0923000 link%3DPKNH_0923000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1123600 link%3DPRCDC_1123600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL2955%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF05405.10%3B%3BE()%3D2.5E-5%3Bscore%3D23.8%3Bquery 211-353%3Bdescription%3DMt_ATP-synt_B,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR008688 :%09ATPase%2C F0 complex%2C subunit B%2C mitochondrial%3BPfam:PF05405%3B%3Bscore%3D2.6E-5%3Bquery 211-353%3Bdescription%3DATP syn