Pf3D7_11_v3	chado	mRNA	2006706	2007829	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1149800.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. B-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:17719658,PMID:10430943,PMID:2842673,PMID:10562315;Parent=PF3D7_1149800;Dbxref=OPI:PF11_0515,MPMP:PF3D7_1149800,UniProtKB:Q8IHM5;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0016020,GO:0020033;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1479600 link%3DPF3D7_1479600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1479600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000200 link%3DPF3D7_1000200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1150000 link%3DPF3D7_1150000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1150000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200200 link%3DPF3D7_0200200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0200200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000400 link%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0401200 link%3DPF3D7_0401200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0401200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300600 link%3DPF3D7_1300600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1300600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1101100 link%3DPF3D7_1101100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1101100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040700 link%3DPF3D7_1040700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum