Pf3D7_11_v3	chado	mRNA	2025817	2035886	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1150400.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSA6-DBLa1.7-CIDRa1.4-DBLb3-DBLb6-DBLd3-CIDRg2-ATSA2 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7606775,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371. PMID:23593462,PMID:6374009;Parent=PF3D7_1150400;Dbxref=OPI:PF11_0521,MPMP:PF3D7_1150400,UniProtKB:Q8IHM0;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 3104-3104%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.76;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0098609,GO:0016021,GO:0009405;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 2718-3119%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-3120%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-2694%3B;orthologous_to=PfalciparumIT:PFIT_1300200 link%3DPFIT_1300200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_1300200.1:pep -> PF3D7_1150400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239500 link%3DPRCDC_1239500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600200 link%3DPF3D7_0600200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0420900 link%3DPF3D7_0420900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712800 link%3DPF3D7_0712800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239900 link%3DPRCDC_1239900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712300 link%3DPF3D7_0712300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0042900 link%3DPRCDC_0042