Pf3D7_12_v3	chado	mRNA	26321	27687	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1200200.1;comment=A-type rifin (PMID:18197962) rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:10430943,PMID:25751816,PMID:10562315,PMID:2842673,PMID:17719658;Parent=PF3D7_1200200;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_1200200,OPI:PFL0010c,UniProtKB:Q8I642;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 340-340%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.12900001;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0020035,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 359-378%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-379%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-335%3B;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0730100 link%3DPRCDC_0730100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0031900 link%3DPRCDC_0031900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600300 link%3DPF3D7_0600300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0632700 link%3DPF3D7_0632700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000400 link%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0042100 link%3DPRCDC_0042100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003200 link%3DPRCDC_0003200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019100 link%3DPRCDC_0019100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0029700 link%3DPRCDC_0029700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0048700 link%3DPRCDC_0048700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0060900 link%3DPRCDC_0060900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410800 link%3DPRCDC_0410800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900600 link%3DPF3D7_0900600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%