Pf3D7_12_v3	chado	mRNA	32703	41940	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1200400.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.18-CIDRa5-DBLb5-DBLg14-DBLz5-DBLe4-ATSB3 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:6374009,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606775;Parent=PF3D7_1200400;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_1200400,OPI:PFL0020w,UniProtKB:Q8I640;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2822-2822%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.46799996;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0098609,GO:0003887,GO:0000166,GO:0003676,GO:0016021,GO:0009405;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324900 link%3DPF3D7_0324900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0017700 link%3DPRCDC_0017700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0007300 link%3DPRCDC_0007300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1200100 link%3DPF3D7_1200100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0056800 link%3DPRCDC_0056800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239600 link%3DPRCDC_1239600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0833500 link%3DPF3D7_0833500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0031700 link%3DPRCDC_0031700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712300 link%3DPF3D7_0712300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115700 link%3DPF3D7_0115700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalci