Pf3D7_12_v3	chado	mRNA	45887	58295	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1200600.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSpam-DBLpam1-DBLpam2-CIDRpam-DBLpam3-DBLepam4-DBLepam5-DBLe10-ATSpam1 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:22570492,PMID:20529864,PMID:27556547,PMID:15520249,PMID:16025132,PMID:20109466,PMID:20169064,PMID:20194779,PMID:31181082,PMID:28698275,PMID:25993442;Parent=PF3D7_1200600;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_1200600,OPI:PFL0030c,UniProtKB:Q8I639;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 3019-3019%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.22799999;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020013,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0035373,GO:0046789,GO:0020035,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0016021,GO:0020036;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324900 link%3DPF3D7_0324900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0017700 link%3DPRCDC_0017700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0007300 link%3DPRCDC_0007300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1200100 link%3DPF3D7_1200100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0056800 link%3DPRCDC_0056800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239600 link%3DPRCDC_1239600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0833500 link%3DPF3D7_0833500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0031700 link%3DPRCDC_0031700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712300 link%3DPF3D7_0712300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pf