Pf3D7_12_v3	chado	mRNA	766654	774197	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1219300.1;comment=domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.16-CIDRa3.4-DBLd1-CIDRg12-ATSB18 (PMID:20862303) var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606788,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606775;Parent=PF3D7_1219300;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_1219300,OPI:PFL0935c,UniProtKB:Q8I5L5;Ontology_term=GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0046789,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020033,GO:0098609,GO:0016021,GO:0009405;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900100 link%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0900100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0221900 link%3DPF3D7_0221900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0221900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_1219000 link%3DPFIT_1219000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_1219000.1:pep -> PF3D7_1219300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324900 link%3DPF3D7_0324900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0017700 link%3DPRCDC_0017700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0007300 link%3DPRCDC_0007300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1200100 link%3DPF3D7_1200100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0056800 link%3DPRCDC_0056800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PR