Pf3D7_12_v3	chado	mRNA	918280	920560	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1222700.1;comment=GAP45 is part of the merozoite glideosome complex that includes MyoA (PF3D7_1342600)%2C GAP50 (PF3D7_0918000) and MTIP (PF3D7_1246400) (PMID:19576251). GAP45 deficient parasites fail to assemble an intact glideosome but show no defect in inner membrane complex formation. GAP45 is dispensable for egress and microneme discharge but essential for invasion (PMID:29970464).;literature=PMID:29970464,PMID:16321976,PMID:22558243,PMID:22479457,PMID:19576251;Parent=PF3D7_1222700;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_1222700,RMgm:PF3D7_1222700,OPI:PFL1090w,UniProtKB:Q8I5I8;Ontology_term=GO:0070258,GO:0019898,GO:0033644,GO:0005515,GO:0005515,GO:0070258,GO:0030260;controlled_curation=term%3Dconditional null mutant phenotype: essential%3Bcv%3DCC_genedb_controlledcuration%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:29970464%3Bdate%3D20180706%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Mutant Phenotype;orthologous_to=,Pchabaudi:PCHAS_1439600 link%3DPCHAS_1439600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_1437600 link%3DPBANKA_1437600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_1440900 link%3DPVP01_1440900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_14048400 link%3DPocGH01_14048400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_1441800 link%3DPKNH_1441800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_14057000 link%3DPmUG01_14057000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1222000 link%3DPRCDC_1222000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00123800 link%3DPGAL8A_00123800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_1438300 link%3DPRELSG_1438300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_1440100 link%3DPY17X_1440100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL573%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Dglideosome-associated protein 45%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:19576251%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Direct Assay;translation=mgnkcsrskvkepkrkdidelaerenlkkqseeiieekpeevveqveetheepleqeqeldeqkieeeeeepeqvpkeeidyatqenksfeekhledlersnsdi