Pf3D7_12_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	1688606	1691162	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1240200.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:6374009,PMID:11544371,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788;Parent=PF3D7_1240200;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_1240200,OPI:PFL1947c;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 475-507%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-851%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-451%3B,%3Bquery 531-837%3B;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239400 link%3DPRCDC_1239400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (EMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL5937%3B rank%3D0,,PfalciparumIT:PFIT_1239900 link%3DPFIT_1239900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_1239900.1:pep -> PF3D7_1240200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B;transmembrane_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 452-474%3B,%3Bquery 508-530%3B;translation=shitkmtlsscgttnktmtniakdilegevsrlkardvidklkgsifdviftndv#*khisreicnittsyyinnsssnnpcegkdkdgk*ltirkvwepdnknvkhnhknvilspkrqymcttnlenlvvdsvtrtgnnnasntflgdvllasnkesqnitqyhpgvsskdqpdvcgdvrysfadiadiirgtdvwskqsqqmllqgyleqtfgkikdkfkgtekydsdshhpqil#iasrlvssksriyvernnkdcftfcgwcykfwnmtgliaetsvlseinktislfrsigddpgrqgaslap#papgvdvlgncdtnlvpgsgggasqhdtqsisssssslsssssspppsqnldtsrsnpsqvsphgpdksyygehtdnqdlykqcphpnhqkpqnttqvihphlidnif+stc+nsfsisldsvpfll