Pf3D7_12_v3	chado	mRNA	1694150	1703087	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1240300.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.7-CIDRa4-DBLb8-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB8 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606788;Parent=PF3D7_1240300;Dbxref=MPMP:PF3D7_1240300,OPI:PFL1950w,UniProtKB:Q8I521;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2608-2608%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.46799996;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020013,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324900 link%3DPF3D7_0324900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0017700 link%3DPRCDC_0017700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0007300 link%3DPRCDC_0007300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1200100 link%3DPF3D7_1200100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0056800 link%3DPRCDC_0056800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1239600 link%3DPRCDC_1239600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0833500 link%3DPF3D7_0833500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019700 link%3DPRCDC_0019700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0031700 link%3DPRCDC_0031700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712300 link%3DPF3D7_0712300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115700 link%3DPF3D7_0115700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300300 link%3DPF3D7_13