Pf3D7_13_v3	chado	mRNA	21364	28787	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1300100.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.11-CIDRa2.4-DBLd1-CIDRb1-ATSB21 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775,PMID:6374009,PMID:11544371,PMID:7606788;Parent=PF3D7_1300100;Dbxref=OPI:MAL13P1.1,MPMP:PF3D7_1300100,UniProtKB:Q8IEV1;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2131-2131%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.342;Ontology_term=GO:0016021,GO:0046789,GO:0009405;controlled_curation=term%3Darginine-methylated protein%3Bcv%3DCC_genedb_controlledcuration%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:27933903%3Bdate%3D20170104%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Direct Assay;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0632800 link%3DPF3D7_0632800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0632800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100100 link%3DPF3D7_1100100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1100100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712300 link%3DPF3D7_0712300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0006900 link%3DPRCDC_0006900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0043300 link%3DPRCDC_0043300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410000 link%3DPRCDC_0410000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0632800 link%3DPF3D7_0632800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808700 link%3DPF3D7_0808700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_