Pf3D7_13_v3	chado	mRNA	30605	31881	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1300200.1;comment=A-type rifin (PMID:18197962) rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:2842673,PMID:10562315,PMID:10430943,PMID:17719658,PMID:25751816;Parent=PF3D7_1300200;Dbxref=OPI:MAL13P1.2,MPMP:PF3D7_1300200,UniProtKB:Q8IEV0;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0020033,GO:0020035,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 329-348%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-349%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-305%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1480000 link%3DPF3D7_1480000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1480000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800500 link%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0401000 link%3DPF3D7_0401000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0401000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300700 link%3DPF3D7_1300700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1300700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0100200 link%3DPF3D7_0100200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0100200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115200 link%3DPF3D7_0115200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0115200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223100 link%3DPF3D7_0223100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040500 link%3DPF3D7_1040500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatc