Pf3D7_13_v3	chado	mRNA	33358	45388	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1300300.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSA3-DBLa1.6-CIDRd1-DBLb3-DBLg12-DBLd5-CIDRb3-DBLb9-ATSA2 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606788;Parent=PF3D7_1300300;Dbxref=OPI:PF13_0003,MPMP:PF3D7_1300300,UniProtKB:Q8IEU9;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 3330-3330%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.1462;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020035,GO:0020030,GO:0050839,GO:0020033,GO:0020013,GO:0098609,GO:0009405,GO:0046789,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712300 link%3DPF3D7_0712300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0006900 link%3DPRCDC_0006900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0043300 link%3DPRCDC_0043300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0410000 link%3DPRCDC_0410000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0632800 link%3DPF3D7_0632800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808700 link%3DPF3D7_0808700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712400 link%3DPF3D7_0712400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1219400 link%3DPF3D7_1219400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1240300 link%3DPF3D7_1240300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0036300 link%3DPRCDC_0036300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0425800 link%3DPF3D7_0425800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0700100 link%3DPF3