Pf3D7_13_v3	chado	mRNA	54067	55259	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1300600.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. B1-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:10430943,PMID:10562315,PMID:17719658,PMID:23259643,PMID:20509952,PMID:2842673;Parent=PF3D7_1300600;Dbxref=OPI:PF13_0006,MPMP:PF3D7_1300600,UniProtKB:Q8IEU6;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0016020,GO:0020033;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 326-345%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-346%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-302%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324400 link%3DPF3D7_0324400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0324400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300400 link%3DPF3D7_1300400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1300400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1150200 link%3DPF3D7_1150200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1150200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1480000 link%3DPF3D7_1480000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1480000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1373100 link%3DPF3D7_1373100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1373100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300700 link%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040700 link%3DPF3D7_1040700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0401200 link%3DPF3D7_0401200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3