Pf3D7_13_v3	chado	mRNA	57109	58422	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1300700.1;comment=A-type rifin (PMID:18197962) rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:25751816,PMID:2842673,PMID:17719658,PMID:10562315,PMID:10430943;Parent=PF3D7_1300700;Dbxref=OPI:MAL13P1.4,MPMP:PF3D7_1300700,UniProtKB:Q8IEU5;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0020033,GO:0020035,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 350-369%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-370%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-326%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1400200 link%3DPF3D7_1400200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1400200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223100 link%3DPF3D7_0223100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115600 link%3DPF3D7_0115600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900600 link%3DPF3D7_0900600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0060900 link%3DPRCDC_0060900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600300 link%3DPF3D7_0600300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900200 link%3DPF3D7_0900200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000400 link%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0003200 link%3DPRCDC_0003200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0029700 link%3DPRCDC_0029700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0042100 link%3DPRCDC_0042100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0019100 link%3DPRCDC_0019100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0035500