Pf3D7_13_v3	chado	mRNA	770473	772913	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1318700.1;comment=The ortholog of PF3D7_1318700 in Toxoplasma (TGGT1_230340) has been named apical annuli protein 4 (AAP4). Annulis are part of the cytoskeleton in Toxoplasma. Five apical annuli proteins have been identified in Toxoplasma. AAP4 is the strongest conserved AAP protein across the Apicomplexa. All other apical annuli proteins are only present in Coccidian (PMID:31470470).;Parent=PF3D7_1318700;Dbxref=OPI:MAL13P1.102,MPMP:PF3D7_1318700,UniProtKB:Q8IEC9;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 726-726%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.3978;Ontology_term=GO:0045177;orthologous_to=Povale:PocGH01_14026800 link%3DPocGH01_14026800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1317700 link%3DPRCDC_1317700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00515000 link%3DPGAL8A_00515000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_14035400 link%3DPmUG01_14035400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_1419500 link%3DPKNH_1419500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_1418900 link%3DPY17X_1418900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_1416600 link%3DPRELSG_1416600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_1419600 link%3DPVP01_1419600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_1417200 link%3DPBANKA_1417200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_1419000 link%3DPCHAS_1419000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL773%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,;product=term%3Dprotein AAP4%2C putative%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:31470470%3Bwith%3DUniProt:S7V2D1%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Sequence Orthology;
