Pf3D7_13_v3	chado	mRNA	2860163	2861441	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1372700.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:10430943,PMID:17719658,PMID:25751816,PMID:10562315,PMID:2842673;Parent=PF3D7_1372700;Dbxref=UniProtKB:C0H5N3,OPI:MAL13P1.500,MPMP:PF3D7_1372700;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0020033,GO:0020035,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 329-348%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-349%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-305%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0401000 link%3DPF3D7_0401000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0401000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732300 link%3DPF3D7_0732300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0732300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1000400 link%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1000400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300700 link%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800500 link%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0222600 link%3DPF3D7_0222600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0222600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223200 link%3DPF3D7_0223200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324400 link%3DPF3D7_0324400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name