Pf3D7_13_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	2865893	2867226	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1372900.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7606775,PMID:11544371,PMID:18785843,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722;Parent=PF3D7_1372900;Dbxref=OPI:MAL13P1.510,MPMP:PF3D7_1372900;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 403-403%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.22799999;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-19%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-444%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 38-437%3B;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0028700 link%3DPRCDC_0028700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0008200 link%3DPRCDC_0008200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300800 link%3DPF3D7_1300800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0014800 link%3DPRCDC_0014800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200300 link%3DPF3D7_0200300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732100 link%3DPF3D7_0732100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0200800 link%3DPF3D7_0200800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0115500 link%3DPF3D7_0115500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324700 link%3DPF3D7_0324700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0900800 link%3DPF3D7_0900800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0222900 link%3DPF3D7_0222900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300300 link%3DPF3D7_0300300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0