Pf3D7_13_v3	chado	mRNA	2884786	2892340	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1373500.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors domain structure: NTSB3-DBLa0.16-CIDRa3.4-DBLd1-CIDRb6-ATSB1 (PMID:20862303);literature=PMID:18785843,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:7606775,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606788;Parent=PF3D7_1373500;Dbxref=OPI:MAL13P1.356,MPMP:PF3D7_1373500,UniProtKB:Q8ID12;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 2185-2185%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.46799996;Ontology_term=GO:0009405,GO:0046789,GO:0016021;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800100 link%3DPF3D7_0800100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0800100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712000 link%3DPF3D7_0712000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0712000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808700 link%3DPF3D7_0808700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1%2C PfEMP1%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0808700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300800 link%3DPF3D7_1300800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1300800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223300 link%3DPF3D7_0223300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C exon 2%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300100 link%3DPF3D7_1300100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bpro