Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	1393	5343	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1400100.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7541722,PMID:6374009,PMID:18785843,PMID:7606775,PMID:7606788,PMID:11544371;Parent=PF3D7_1400100;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0001,MPMP:PF3D7_1400100;gPI_anchor_cleavage_site=%3Bquery 939-939%3BGPI_cleavage_site_score%3D0.46799996;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_0012000 link%3DPRCDC_0012000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0036900 link%3DPRCDC_0036900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0712600 link%3DPF3D7_0712600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0016700 link%3DPRCDC_0016700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0037500 link%3DPRCDC_0037500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0418600 link%3DPRCDC_0418600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800100 link%3DPF3D7_0800100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0004000 link%3DPRCDC_0004000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0833500 link%3DPF3D7_0833500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0036700 link%3DPRCDC_0036700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0600600 link%3DPF3D7_0600600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100100 link%3DPF3D7_1100100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0012200 link%3DPRCDC_0012200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_0042900 link%3DPRCDC_0042900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pfalciparum:PF3D7_