Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	mRNA	17469	18808	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1400500.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. B-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:10562315,PMID:10430943,PMID:17719658,PMID:2842673;Parent=PF3D7_1400500;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0005,MPMP:PF3D7_1400500,UniProtKB:Q8IM83;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0016020,GO:0020033;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 320-339%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-340%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-296%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0114700 link%3DPF3D7_0114700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0114700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040500 link%3DPF3D7_1040500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732400 link%3DPF3D7_0732400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0732400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1372600 link%3DPF3D7_1372600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1372600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400300 link%3DPF3D7_0400300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0400300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324400 link%3DPF3D7_0324400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0324400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1150000 link%3DPF3D7_1150000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1150000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0223400 link%3DPF3D7_0223400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0223400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,PfalciparumIT:PFIT