Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	mRNA	20897	22232	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1400600.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. A-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:10562315,PMID:25751816,PMID:2842673,PMID:10430943,PMID:17719658;Parent=PF3D7_1400600;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0006,MPMP:PF3D7_1400600,UniProtKB:Q8IM82;Ontology_term=GO:0020033,GO:0020002,GO:0020036,GO:0020003,GO:0020035,GO:0020013;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 349-367%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-368%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-325%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1373300 link%3DPF3D7_1373300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1373300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0101900 link%3DPF3D7_0101900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0101900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0800500 link%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0800500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300800 link%3DPF3D7_0300800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0201000 link%3DPF3D7_0201000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0201000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0701300 link%3DPF3D7_0701300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0701300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1373400 link%3DPF3D7_1373400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1373400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732200 link%3DPF3D7_0732200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bpr