Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	mRNA	27321	28428	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1400800.1;comment=B-type rifin (PMID:18197962) rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:10430943,PMID:17719658,PMID:10562315,PMID:2842673;Parent=PF3D7_1400800;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0008,MPMP:PF3D7_1400800,UniProtKB:Q8IM80;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0016020,GO:0020033;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 27-118%3B,%3Bquery 297-316%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-317%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-3%3B,%3Bquery 142-273%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1300400 link%3DPF3D7_1300400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1300400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0201000 link%3DPF3D7_0201000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0201000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1372700 link%3DPF3D7_1372700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1372700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0401200 link%3DPF3D7_0401200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0401200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0701800 link%3DPF3D7_0701800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0701800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100400 link%3DPF3D7_1100400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1100400.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040500 link%3DPF3D7_1040500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732400 link%3DPF3D7_0732400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DP