Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	mRNA	1232648	1237614	.	-	.	ID=PF3D7_1431400.1;comment=PF3D7_1431400 is associated with antimalarial drug resistance (PMID:21533027). PF3D7_1431400 has been named surface-related antigen SRA (PMID:29912472). SRA is  localized on the surfaces of both merozoites and gametocytes. Parasite growth inhibition assays showed that SRA antibodies inhibited erythrocyte invasion. It is potentially a promising target for vaccine development (PMID:29912472).;literature=PMID:29912472;Parent=PF3D7_1431400;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0293,MPMP:PF3D7_1431400,RMgm:PF3D7_1431400,UniProtKB:Q8ILF1;Ontology_term=GO:0009986,GO:0030260,GO:0046812;orthologous_to=,Pberghei:PBANKA_1013400 link%3DPBANKA_1013400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_13028800 link%3DPmUG01_13028800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_1014200 link%3DPCHAS_1014200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1430700 link%3DPRCDC_1430700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00303000 link%3DPGAL8A_00303000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_1318000 link%3DPVP01_1318000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_13028800 link%3DPocGH01_13028800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_1319700 link%3DPRELSG_1319700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_1327300 link%3DPKNH_1327300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_1014900 link%3DPY17X_1014900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL2643%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;product=term%3Dsurface-related antigen SRA%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:29912472%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Direct Assay;signal_peptide=signalp%3B%3Bquery 1-25%3Bcleavage_site_probability%3D0.528;
