Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	mRNA	1476538	1483887	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1436300.1;comment=PTEX150 is a component of the PTEX complex (Plasmodium translocon of exported proteins). It localises to the apical complex in free merozoites and the parasitophorous vacuolar membrane in ring stage parasites (PMID:19536257). PTEX150 forms an adaptor between HSP101 (PF3D7_1116800) and EXP2 (PF3D7_1471100) (PMID:30150771).;literature=PMID:22253438,PMID:19536257,PMID:25043043,PMID:27019089,PMID:30150771;Parent=PF3D7_1436300;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0344,MPMP:PF3D7_1436300,RMgm:PF3D7_1436300,UniProtKB:Q8ILA1;Ontology_term=GO:0020007,GO:0020005,GO:0005515,GO:0044053,GO:0097619,GO:0020026,GO:0097619,GO:1903561,GO:0005634;orthologous_to=Pyoelii:PY17X_1010100 link%3DPY17X_1010100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_1009400 link%3DPCHAS_1009400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_13024000 link%3DPocGH01_13024000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_13024000 link%3DPmUG01_13024000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_1314800 link%3DPRELSG_1314800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_1313200 link%3DPVP01_1313200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_0422900 link%3DPKNH_0422900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1435600 link%3DPRCDC_1435600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_1008500 link%3DPBANKA_1008500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00307800 link%3DPGAL8A_00307800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL2687%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,;product=term%3Dtranslocon component PTEX150%3Bdb_xref%3DPMID:19536257%3Bevidence%3DInferred from Direct Assay;signal_peptide=signalp%3B%3Bquery 1-21%3Bcleavage_site_probability%3D0.578;
