Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	mRNA	2123012	2126797	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1451800.1;comment=Sortilin (VPS10) potentially acts as an escorter that transports the RAMA-RAP1 complex from the Golgi apparatus to the rhoptries (PMID:29299530). Knockdown of Sortilin showed that it is essential for the transport of proteins from the Golgi apparatus to rhoptries%2C micronemes and dense granules%2C organelles that form the apical complex. Knockdown of Sortilin also disrupts IMC (inner membrane complex) biogenesis and prevents merozoite formation (PMID:29582546).;literature=PMID:22607804,PMID:24587025,PMID:29299530,PMID:29582546;Parent=PF3D7_1451800;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0493,MPMP:PF3D7_1451800,UniProtKB:Q8IKV8;Ontology_term=GO:0005794,GO:0005515,GO:0005801,GO:0005783,GO:0015031,GO:0016021;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-39%3B,%3Bquery 792-895%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-896%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 63-771%3B;orthologous_to=Preichenowi:PRCDC_1451100 link%3DPRCDC_1451100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Prelictum:PRELSG_1229200 link%3DPRELSG_1229200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00211000 link%3DPGAL8A_00211000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pchabaudi:PCHAS_1318800 link%3DPCHAS_1318800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_1255200 link%3DPVP01_1255200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pmalariae:PmUG01_12065200 link%3DPmUG01_12065200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_1230300 link%3DPKNH_1230300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pyoelii:PY17X_1319300 link%3DPY17X_1319300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pberghei:PBANKA_1315500 link%3DPBANKA_1315500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_12063100 link%3DPocGH01_12063100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL1408%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0,;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF15901.1%3B%3BE()%3D1.6E-42%3Bscore%3D145.6%3Bquery 602-761%3Bdescription%3DSortilin_C,pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF15902.1%3B%3BE()%3D7.5E-52%3Bscore%3D176.4%3Bquery 439-598%3Bd