Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	mRNA	3131104	3131637	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1476100.1;comment=associated with antimalarial drug resistance (PMID:21533027) Early transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP) family member.  Plasmodium conserved family with greater than ten members in P. falciparum.  ETRAMPs are abundantly expressed early in the intraerythrocytic cycle and are small (frequently less than 200 aa) integral membrane proteins that are localized within the parasitophorous vacuolar membrane (PVM).  All members have signal peptides plus a transmembrane domain.  Some members are expressed during hepatocyte development and their targeted gene disruption results in a block in hepatocyte development.;literature=PMID:16420351,PMID:15699336,PMID:15580261,PMID:12615320,PMID:12686607;Parent=PF3D7_1476100;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0729,MPMP:PF3D7_1476100,UniProtKB:Q8IK77;Ontology_term=GO:0020005;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 27-51%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-178%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-3%3B,%3Bquery 75-177%3B;orthologous_to=PfalciparumIT:PFIT_1477200 link%3DPFIT_1477200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B product%3Dearly transcribed membrane protein 14.2%3B match_name%3Dorthomcl:orthomcl: PFIT_1477200.1:pep -> PF3D7_1476100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,,Pmalariae:PmUG01_12081000 link%3DPmUG01_12081000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Povale:PocGH01_12079600 link%3DPocGH01_12079600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pknowlesi:PKNH_1246400 link%3DPKNH_1246400.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Preichenowi:PRCDC_1475200 link%3DPRCDC_1475200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C PvivaxP01:PVP01_1271000 link%3DPVP01_1271000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%2C Pgallinaceum:PGAL8A_00195000 link%3DPGAL8A_00195000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3B cluster_name%3DPlasmodium:ORTHOMCL4912%3B program%3DOrthoMCL%3B rank%3D0;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF09716.6%3B%3BE()%3D1.9E-14%3Bscore%3D53.4%3Bquery 1-78%3Bdescription%3DETRAMP,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR006389 :%09Early transcribed membrane protein (ETRAMP)