Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	mRNA	3266136	3267377	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1479400.1;comment=rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion. B-type rifin (PMID:18197962);literature=PMID:17719658,PMID:10562315,PMID:10430943,PMID:2842673;Parent=PF3D7_1479400;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0766,MPMP:PF3D7_1479400,UniProtKB:Q8IK44;Ontology_term=GO:0020002,GO:0016020,GO:0020033;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-121%3B,%3Bquery 340-359%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-360%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 145-316%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1301000 link%3DPF3D7_1301000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%2C pseudogene%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1301000.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300700 link%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732200 link%3DPF3D7_0732200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0732200.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1040800 link%3DPF3D7_1040800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1040800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1479800 link%3DPF3D7_1479800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1479800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0808900 link%3DPF3D7_0808900.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0808900.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1100500 link%3DPF3D7_1100500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1100500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0401200 link%3DPF3D7_0401200.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_