Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	mRNA	3272578	3273848	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1479600.1;comment=B-type rifin (PMID:18197962) rif (repetitive interspersed family) genes were originally identified by Weber%3B they encode clonally variant RIFIN proteins%2C which are likely expressed on the infected erythrocyte surface%2C in Maurer's clefts and on merozoites. Originally classed with stevors%2C rifs are clearly a distinct family%2C with 150 or so copies per haploid genome. Surface expression indicates possible role in immune evasion.;literature=PMID:2842673,PMID:10562315,PMID:17719658,PMID:10430943;Parent=PF3D7_1479600;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0768,MPMP:PF3D7_1479600,UniProtKB:Q8IK42;Ontology_term=GO:0016020,GO:0020002,GO:0020033;cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 27-121%3B,%3Bquery 331-350%3B;membrane_structure=tmhmm%3B%3Bquery 1-351%3B;non_cytoplasmic_polypeptide_region=%3Bquery 1-3%3B,%3Bquery 145-307%3B;orthologous_to=Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0400500 link%3DPF3D7_0400500.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0400500.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0300700 link%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0300700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1150300 link%3DPF3D7_1150300.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1150300.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0732700 link%3DPF3D7_0732700.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0732700.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_0324800 link%3DPF3D7_0324800.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_0324800.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1101100 link%3DPF3D7_1101100.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1101100.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1372600 link%3DPF3D7_1372600.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3Drifin%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3D7_1372600.1:pep%3B rank%3D0,Pfalciparum:PF3D7_1480000 link%3DPF3D7_1480000.1:pep type%3Dorthologous_to%3Bproduct%3DPIR protein%3Bmatch_name%3DPF3