Pf3D7_14_v3	chado	pseudogenic_transcript	3290953	3291501	.	+	.	ID=PF3D7_1480100.1;comment=var genes encode a family of clonally variant antigens collectively termed P. falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1). Mutually exclusive var gene regulation results in expression of a single PfEMP1 variant on the surface of each parasite-infected erythrocyte. Such expression coordination is critical in PfEMP1's role in evasion of host immune responses%2C but PfEMP1 is also involved in cytoadherence to host tissues and cells. Cytoadherence is associated with pathogenesis%2C implicating members of the PfEMP1 family as major virulence factors;literature=PMID:7606788,PMID:7541722,PMID:7606775,PMID:11544371,PMID:6374009,PMID:18785843;Parent=PF3D7_1480100;Dbxref=OPI:PF14_0773,MPMP:PF3D7_1480100;Ontology_term=GO:0046789,GO:0016021,GO:0009405;polypeptide_domain=pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF05424.7%3B%3BE()%3D4.3E-17%3Bscore%3D62.6%3Bquery 109-180%3Bdescription%3DDuffy_binding,pfam_scan%3BPfam:PF15447.2%3B%3BE()%3D2.6E-9%3Bscore%3D37.3%3Bquery 13-47%3Bdescription%3DNTS,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR029210 :%09Plasmodium falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein-1%2C N-terminal segment%3BPfam:PF15447%3B%3Bscore%3D2.6E-9%3Bquery 13-47%3Bdescription%3DPlasmodium falciparum erythrocyte membrane protein-1%2C N-terminal segment,iprscan%3BInterPro:IPR008602 :%09Plasmodium Duffy binding%3BPfam:PF05424%3B%3Bscore%3D4.8E-17%3Bquery 109-180%3Bdescription%3DDuffy-antigen binding,iprscan%3BSuperfamily:SSF140924%3B%3Bscore%3D5.76E-27%3Bquery 46-180%3Bdescription%3Dnull;product=term%3Derythrocyte membrane protein 1 (PfEMP1)%2C pseudogene%3B;translation=mapqraadsnkrakevldeigkevekkataeavpyqnalqgilsqakfhgqsihvknpcdlkyeihtnvakdrekenpcrgrveerfsdsrsgqctnrrikgnntenggacapyrrlhicdrnlelikpdqitsthnllvdvllaakhegkslvdkhkkykethkdtnictvlarsfagfrv
